helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3156380	34			0	uk	MDETERM(Array)				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3150290	35			0	uk	\<emph\>Array\</emph\> represents a square array in which the determinants are defined.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN11035				0	uk	You can find a general introduction to using Array functions on top of this page.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN11333				0	uk	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#moreontop\"/\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151348				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>MINVERSE function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>inverse arrays\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
