helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3145880	144			0	uk	F4: The standard error of the regression calculated for the Y value.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3145894	145			0	uk	E5: The F value from the variance analysis.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3145915	146			0	uk	F5: The degrees of freedom from the variance analysis.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3145937	147			0	uk	E6: The sum of the squared deviation of the estimated Y values from their linear mean.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3145952	148			0	uk	F6: The sum of the squared deviation of the estimated Y value from the given Y values.				20220827 09:49:47
