helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146009	150			0	uk	LOGEST				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3146037	151			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_RKP\"\>This function calculates the adjustment of the entered data as an exponential regression curve (y=b*m^x).\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
