helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3163137	154			0	uk	\<emph\>DataY\</emph\> represents the Y Data array.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3163155	155			0	uk	\<emph\>DataX\</emph\> (optional) represents the X Data array.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3163174	156			0	uk	\<emph\>FunctionType\</emph\> (optional). If Function_Type = 0, functions in the form y = m^x will be calculated. Otherwise, y = b*m^x functions will be calculated.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3163196	157			0	uk	\<emph\>Stats\</emph\> (optional). If Stats=0, only the regression coefficient is calculated.				20220827 09:49:47
