helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3163314	162			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_SUMMENPRODUKT\"\>Multiplies corresponding elements in the given arrays, and returns the sum of those products.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
