helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id1551561				0	uk	See \<link href=\"https://wiki.openoffice.org/wiki/Calc/Features/JIS_and_ASC_functions\"\>JIS and ASC Spreadsheet Functions\</link\> for a conversion table.				20220827 09:49:47
