helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3147274	99			0	uk	            \<emph\>Text\</emph\> is the text where the initial partial words are to be determined.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153152	100			0	uk	            \<emph\>Number\</emph\> (optional) specifies the number of characters for the start text. If this parameter is not defined, one character is returned.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150260	101			0	uk	Example				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149141	102			0	uk	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=LEFT("output";3)\</item\> returns “out”.				20220827 09:49:47
