helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154063	107			0	uk	LEN("Text")				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3146894	108			0	uk	            \<emph\>Text\</emph\> is the text whose length is to be determined.				20220827 09:49:47
