helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156008	110			0	uk	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=LEN("Good Afternoon")\</item\> returns 14.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154300	111			0	uk	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=LEN(12345.67)\</item\> returns 8.				20220827 09:49:47
