helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3150638	198			0	uk	            \<emph\>Number\</emph\> is the number of repetitions.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149922	212			0	uk	The result can be a maximum of 255 characters.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156213	199			0	uk	Example				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3148626	200			0	uk	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=REPT("Good morning";2)\</item\> returns Good morningGood morning.				20220827 09:49:47
