helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3145375	114			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_RECHTS\"\>Returns the last character or characters of a text.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
