helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149426	117			0	uk	            \<emph\>Text\</emph\> is the text of which the right part is to be determined.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153350	118			0	uk	            \<emph\>Number\</emph\> (optional) is the number of characters from the right part of the text.				20220827 09:49:47
