helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3148692	123			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_SUCHEN\"\>Returns the position of a text segment within a character string.\</ahelp\> You can set the start of the search as an option. The search text can be a number or any sequence of characters. The search is not case-sensitive.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152964	124			0	uk	Syntax				20220827 09:49:47
