helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3146080	126			0	uk	            \<emph\>FindText\</emph\> is the text to be searched for.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154111	127			0	uk	            \<emph\>Text\</emph\> is the text where the search will take place.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149559	128			0	uk	            \<emph\>Position\</emph\> (optional) is the position in the text where the search is to start.				20220827 09:49:47
