helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154726	144			0	uk	If \<emph\>Value\</emph\> is a text string or refers to a text string, T returns that text string; otherwise it returns a blank text string.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155544	145			0	uk	Example				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3151062	146			0	uk	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=T(12345)\</item\> returns an empty string. 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id4650105				0	uk	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=T("12345")\</item\> returns the string 12345.				20220827 09:49:47
