helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156167	163			0	uk	            \<emph\>Format\</emph\> is the text which defines the format. Use decimal and thousands separators according to the language set in the cell format.				20220827 09:49:47
