helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_month.xhp	0	help	par_id3149485	80			0	uk	\<emph\>Number\</emph\>, as a time value, is a decimal for which the month is to be returned.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_month.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153322	81			0	uk	Examples				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_month.xhp	0	help	par_id3149244	83			0	uk	=MONTH(NOW()) returns the current month.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_month.xhp	0	help	par_id3154790	84			0	uk	=MONTH(C4) returns 7 if you enter 2000-07-07 to cell C4 (that date value might get formatted differently after you press Enter).				20220827 09:49:47
