helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153969	2			0	uk	\<variable id=\"namenuebernehmentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CreateNames\"\>Allows you to automatically name multiple cell ranges.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280	13			0	uk	Select the area containing all the ranges that you want to name. Then choose \<emph\>Insert - Names - Create\</emph\>. This opens the \<emph\>Create Names\</emph\> dialog, from which you can select the naming options that you want.				20220827 09:49:47
