helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3152597	4			0	uk	Defines which part of the spreadsheet is to be used for creating the name.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153729	5			0	uk	Top row				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149263	6			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_NAMES_CREATE:BTN_TOP\"\>Creates the range names from the header row of the selected range.\</ahelp\> Each column receives a separated name and cell reference.				20220827 09:49:47
