helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155855	2			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Manages print ranges. Only cells within the print ranges will be printed.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119	4			0	uk	If you do not define any print range manually, Calc assigns an automatic print range to include all the cells that are not empty.				20220827 09:49:47
