helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3146120	5			0	uk	You will also find a \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060112.xhp\"\>description of the $[officename] Calc add-in interface\</link\> in the Help. In addition, important functions and their parameters are described in the Help for the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>Shared Library \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>$[officename] Calc add-in DLL\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>.				20220827 09:49:47
