helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3153803	47			0	uk	\<emph\>Date\</emph\> is any date in the respective year. The Date parameter must be a valid date according to the locale settings of %PRODUCTNAME.				20220827 09:49:47
