helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3153340	58			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DAI_FUNC_DIFFWEEKS\"\>Calculates the difference in weeks between two dates.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
