helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150767	3			0	uk	In contrast to copying an area to the clipboard, you can filter certain information and calculate values. This command is only visible if you have selected two sheets in the document. To select multiple sheets, click each sheet tab while pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\> \<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\> \<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\> \</switchinline\> or Shift.				20220827 09:49:47
