helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148685	145			0	uk	Syntax				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149585	146			0	uk	COUPDAYS(Settlement; Maturity; Frequency; Basis)				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3152767	147			0	uk	\<emph\>Settlement\</emph\> is the date of purchase of the security.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3151250	148			0	uk	\<emph\>Maturity\</emph\> is the date on which the security matures (expires).				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3146126	149			0	uk	\<emph\>Frequency\</emph\> is number of interest payments per year (1, 2 or 4).				20220827 09:49:47
