helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3147530	151			0	uk	A security is purchased on 2001-01-25; the date of maturity is 2001-11-15. Interest is paid half-yearly (frequency is 2). Using daily balance interest calculation (basis 3) how many days are there in the interest period in which the settlement date falls?				20220827 09:49:47
