helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3154667	188			0	uk	\<emph\>Maturity\</emph\> is the date on which the security matures (expires).				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3154569	189			0	uk	\<emph\>Frequency\</emph\> is the number of interest payments per year (1, 2 or 4).				20220827 09:49:47
