helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149339				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>IPMT function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>periodic amortizement rates\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
