helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3154522	264			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ZINSZ\"\>Calculates the periodic amortizement for an investment with regular payments and a constant interest rate.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153266	265			0	uk	Syntax				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3151283	266			0	uk	IPMT(Rate; Period; NPer; PV; FV; Type)				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3147313	267			0	uk	\<emph\>Rate\</emph\> is the periodic interest rate.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3145158	268			0	uk	\<emph\>Period\</emph\> is the period, for which the compound interest is calculated. Period=NPER if compound interest for the last period is calculated.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3147577	269			0	uk	\<emph\>NPer\</emph\> is the total number of periods, during which annuity is paid.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3156211	270			0	uk	\<emph\>PV\</emph\> is the present cash value in sequence of payments.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3151213	271			0	uk	\<emph\>FV\</emph\> (optional) is the desired value (future value) at the end of the periods.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3154195	272			0	uk	\<emph\>Type\</emph\> is the due date for the periodic payments.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150102	273			0	uk	Example				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149438	274			0	uk	What is the interest rate during the fifth period (year) if the constant interest rate is 5% and the cash value is 15,000 currency units? The periodic payment is seven years.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150496	275			0	uk	\<item type=\"input\"\>=IPMT(5%;5;7;15000)\</item\> = -352.97 currency units. The compound interest during the fifth period (year) is 352.97 currency units.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151205				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>calculating;future values\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>future values;constant interest rates\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>FV function\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
