helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3155136	281			0	uk	\<emph\>Rate\</emph\> is the periodic interest rate.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3156029	282			0	uk	\<emph\>NPer\</emph\> is the total number of periods (payment period).				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3151322	283			0	uk	\<emph\>Pmt\</emph\> is the annuity paid regularly per period.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3145256	284			0	uk	\<emph\>PV\</emph\> (optional) is the (present) cash value of an investment.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150999	285			0	uk	\<emph\>Type\</emph\> (optional) defines whether the payment is due at the beginning or the end of a period.				20220827 09:49:47
