helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3146813	287			0	uk	What is the value at the end of an investment if the interest rate is 4% and the payment period is two years, with a periodic payment of 750 currency units. The investment has a present value of 2,500 currency units.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149302	288			0	uk	\<item type=\"input\"\>=FV(4%;2;750;2500) \</item\>= -4234.00 currency units. The value at the end of the investment is 4234.00 currency units.				20220827 09:49:47
