helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3157993	61			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ARCOSHYP\"\>Returns the inverse hyperbolic cosine of a number.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145295	62			0	uk	Syntax				20220827 09:49:47
