helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3155375	76			0	uk	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ACOT(1)\</item\> returns 0.785398163397448 (PI/4 radians).				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id8589434				0	uk	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DEGREES(ACOT(1))\</item\> returns 45. The tangent of 45 degrees is 1. 				20220827 09:49:47
