helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3146155	84			0	uk	 This function returns the inverse hyperbolic cotangent of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>, that is the number whose hyperbolic cotangent is Number.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id5818659				0	uk	An error results if Number is between -1 and 1 inclusive.				20220827 09:49:47
