helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id5036164				0	uk	ATAN2 returns the inverse trigonometric tangent, that is, the angle (in radians) between the x-axis and a line from point NumberX, NumberY to the origin. The angle returned is between -PI and PI.				20220827 09:49:47
