helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145213				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>LCM function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>least common multiples\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>lowest common multiples\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
