helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3147279	268			0	uk	LCM(Integer1; Integer2; ...; Integer30)				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3156348	269			0	uk	\<emph\>Integer1 to 30\</emph\> are up to 30 integers whose lowest common multiple is to be calculated.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156431	270			0	uk	Example				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154914	271			0	uk	If you enter the numbers \<item type=\"input\"\>512\</item\>;\<item type=\"input\"\>1024\</item\> and \<item type=\"input\"\>2000\</item\> in the Integer 1;2 and 3 text boxes, 128000 will be returned as the result.				20220827 09:49:47
