helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152224	447			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_TAN\"\>Returns the tangent of the given angle (in radians).\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152242	448			0	uk	Syntax				20220827 09:49:47
