helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3165462	457			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_TANHYP\"\>Returns the hyperbolic tangent of a number.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
