helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3146866	6			0	uk	            \<emph\>Number\</emph\> is probability value for which the inverse F distribution is to be calculated.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3153914	7			0	uk	            \<emph\>DegreesFreedom1\</emph\> is the number of degrees of freedom in the numerator of the F distribution.				20220827 09:49:47
