helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_timevalue.xhp	0	help	bm_id3146755				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>TIMEVALUE function\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_timevalue.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146755	160			0	uk	\<variable id=\"timevalue\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/func_timevalue.xhp\"\>TIMEVALUE\</link\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_timevalue.xhp	0	help	par_id3148502	161			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ZEITWERT\"\>TIMEVALUE returns the internal time number from a text enclosed by quotes and which may show a possible time entry format.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_timevalue.xhp	0	help	par_id3150794	162			0	uk	The internal number indicated as a decimal is the result of the date system used under $[officename] to calculate date entries.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_timevalue.xhp	0	help	par_id011920090347118				0	uk	If the text string also includes a year, month, or day, TIMEVALUE only returns the fractional part of the conversion.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_timevalue.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150810	163			0	uk	Syntax				20220827 09:49:47
