helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3150363	140			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MAXA\"\>Returns the maximum value in a list of arguments. In opposite to MAX, here you can enter text. The value of the text is 0.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id7689443				0	uk	The functions MINA() and MAXA() return 0 if no value (numeric or text) and no error was encountered.				20220827 09:49:47
