helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153820				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>MEDIAN function\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153820	11			0	uk	MEDIAN				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3151241	12			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MEDIAN\"\>Returns the median of a set of numbers. In a set containing an uneven number of values, the median will be the number in the middle of the set and in a set containing an even number of values, it will be the mean of the two values in the middle of the set.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148871	13			0	uk	Syntax				20220827 09:49:47
