helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3150109	15			0	uk	\<emph\>Number1; Number2;...Number30\</emph\> are values or ranges, which represent a sample. Each number can also be replaced by a reference.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144506	16			0	uk	Example				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3145078	17			0	uk	for an odd number: \<item type=\"input\"\>=MEDIAN(1;5;9;20;21)\</item\> returns 9 as the median value.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3149126	165			0	uk	for an even number: \<item type=\"input\"\>=MEDIAN(1;5;9;20)\</item\> returns the average of the two middle values 5 and 9, thus 7.				20220827 09:49:47
