helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147567	89			0	uk	Example				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3151187	90			0	uk	\<item type=\"input\"\>=PEARSON(A1:A30;B1:B30)\</item\> returns the Pearson correlation coefficient of both data sets.				20220827 09:49:47
