helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3150254	93			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_PHI\"\>Returns the values of the distribution function for a standard normal distribution.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154748	94			0	uk	Syntax				20220827 09:49:47
