helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3154298	103			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_POISSON\"\>Returns the Poisson distribution.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
