helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02180000.xhp	0	help	par_id2282479				0	uk	When you copy and paste cells containing \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060102.xhp\"\>date values\</link\> between different spreadsheets, both spreadsheet documents must be set to the same date base. If date bases differ, the displayed date values will change!				20220827 09:49:47
