helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_day.xhp	0	help	par_id3147584	107			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_TAG\"\>Returns the day of given date value.\</ahelp\> The day is returned as an integer between 1 and 31. You can also enter a negative date/time value.				20220827 09:49:47
