helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155431	158			0	uk	To find the standard deviation of the weight for all children of the same age at Joe's birthday party (scroll up, please), enter the following formula in B16:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148411	159			0	uk	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DSTDEVP(A1:E10;"Weight";A13:E14)\</item\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3143271	160			0	uk	In row 14, under Age, enter \<item type=\"input\"\>7, 8, 9,\</item\> and so on, one after the other. The result is the standard deviation of the weight for all same-aged children whose weight was checked.				20220827 09:49:47
