helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150596	168			0	uk	Enter \<item type=\"input\"\>2\</item\> in row 14 under Grade. The sum (1950) of the distances to school of all the children who are in second grade is displayed.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155614				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>DVAR function\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>variances;based on samples\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
