helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153379	2			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:TABPAGE:TP_VALIDATION_ERROR\"\>Define the error message that is displayed when invalid data is entered in a cell.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154138	25			0	uk	You can also start a macro with an error message. A sample macro is provided at the end of this page.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156280	3			0	uk	Show error message when invalid values are entered.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150768	4			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the error message that you enter in the \<emph\>Contents\</emph\> area when invalid data is entered in a cell.\</ahelp\> If enabled, the message is displayed to prevent an invalid entry.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3146984	5			0	uk	In both cases, if you select "Stop", the invalid entry is deleted and the previous value is reentered in the cell. The same applies if you close the "Warning" and "Information" dialogs by clicking the \<emph\>Cancel \</emph\>button. If you close the dialogs with the \<emph\>OK\</emph\> button, the invalid entry is not deleted.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152460	6			0	uk	Contents				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148646	8			0	uk	Action				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3151115	9			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:TP_VALIDATION_ERROR:LB_ACTION\"\>Select the action that you want to occur when invalid data is entered in a cell.\</ahelp\> The "Stop" action rejects the invalid entry and displays a dialog that you have to close by clicking \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. The "Warning" and "Information" actions display a dialog that can be closed by clicking \<emph\>OK\</emph\> or \<emph\>Cancel\</emph\>. The invalid entry is only rejected when you click \<emph\>Cancel\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
