helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149898	44			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_FAP_FORMULA\"\>Displays the created formula. Type your entries directly, or create the formula using the wizard.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153249	45			0	uk	Back				20220827 09:49:47
