helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149316	55			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FORMULA:BTN_FORWARD\"\>Moves forward through the formula components in the formula window.\</ahelp\> This button can also be used to assign functions to the formula. If you select a function and click the \<emph\>Next \</emph\>button, the selection appears in the formula window.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159262	57			0	uk	Double-click a function in the selection window to transfer it to the formula window.				20220827 09:49:47
