helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154123	31			0	uk	Use the mouse to define ranges or type the reference into the \<emph\>Define Name \</emph\>dialog fields.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155131	30			0	uk	The \<emph\>Sheet Area\</emph\> box on the Formula bar contains a list of defined names for the ranges. Click a name from this box to highlight the corresponding reference on the spreadsheet. Names given formulas or parts of a formula are not listed here.				20220827 09:49:47
