helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3156146	237			0	uk	\<item type=\"input\"\>=NOMINAL_ADD(5.3543%;4)\</item\> returns 0.0525 or 5.25%.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	bm_id3159087				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>DOLLARFR function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>converting;decimal fractions, into mixed decimal fractions\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
