helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150593	209			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_DOLLARFR\"\>Converts a quotation that has been given as a decimal number into a mixed decimal fraction.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
