helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3149558	212			0	uk	\<emph\>DecimalDollar\</emph\> is a decimal number.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153672	213			0	uk	\<emph\>Fraction\</emph\> is a whole number that is used as the denominator of the decimal fraction.				20220827 09:49:47
