helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153795	215			0	uk	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DOLLARFR(1.125;16)\</item\> converts into sixteenths. The result is 1.02 for 1 plus 2/16.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150995	216			0	uk	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DOLLARFR(1.125;8)\</item\> converts into eighths. The result is 1.1 for 1 plus 1/8.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154671				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>fractions; converting\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>converting;decimal fractions, into decimal numbers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>DOLLARDE function\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154671	199			0	uk	DOLLARDE				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154418	200			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_DOLLARDE\"\>Converts a quotation that has been given as a decimal fraction into a decimal number.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
