helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3149309	157			0	uk	\<emph\>Settlement\</emph\> is the date of purchase of the security.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3151381	158			0	uk	\<emph\>Maturity\</emph\> is the date on which the security matures (expires).				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153302	159			0	uk	\<emph\>Issue\</emph\> is the date of issue of the security.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3147140	160			0	uk	\<emph\>Rate\</emph\> is the interest rate of the security on the issue date.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3151067	161			0	uk	\<emph\>Price\</emph\> is the price (purchase price) of the security per 100 currency units of par value.				20220827 09:49:47
