helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147394	5			0	uk	Cell Value / Formula				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155602	6			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:RID_SCDLG_CONDFORMAT:LB_COND3_1\"\>Specifies if conditional formatting is dependent on a cell value or a formula.\</ahelp\> If you select a formula as a reference, the \<emph\>Cell Value Condition\</emph\> box is displayed to the right of the \<emph\>Cell value/Formula\</emph\> field. If the condition is "Formula is", enter a cell reference. If the cell reference is a value other than zero, the condition matches.				20220827 09:49:47
