helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149262	4			0	uk	This area contains the options available for inserting cells into a sheet. The cell quantity and position is defined by selecting a cell range in the sheet beforehand.				20220827 09:49:47
