helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3150150	65			0	uk	\<emph\>Reference\</emph\> indicates the reference to a cell in which a test will be performed to determine if it contains a formula.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147491	66			0	uk	Example				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3159182	67			0	uk	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISFORMULA(C4)\</item\> returns FALSE if the cell C4 contains the number \<item type=\"input\"\>5\</item\>.				20220827 09:49:47
