helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3146946	89			0	uk	Returns TRUE if \<emph\>Value\</emph\> is a logical value (TRUE or FALSE), and returns FALSE otherwise.				20220827 09:49:47
