helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3148740	49			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_WENN\"\>Specifies a logical test to be performed.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
