helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3147522	211			0	uk	            \<emph\>Number\</emph\> is the number to be converted.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3154472	212			0	uk	            \<emph\>FromUnit\</emph\> is the unit from which conversion is taking place.				20220827 09:49:47
