helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156270	214			0	uk	Examples				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3156336	215			0	uk	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=CONVERT_ADD(10;"HP";"PS") \</item\>returns, rounded to two decimal places, 10.14. 10 HP equal 10.14 PS.				20220827 09:49:47
