helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3151309	37			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_FACTDOUBLE\"\>Returns the double factorial of a number.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154666	38			0	uk	Syntax				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3155121	39			0	uk	FACTDOUBLE(Number)				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3158440	40			0	uk	Returns \<emph\>Number\</emph\>            \<emph\>!!\</emph\>, the double factorial of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>, where \<emph\>Number\</emph\> is an integer greater than or equal to zero.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id2480849				0	uk	For even numbers FACTDOUBLE(n) returns:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id4181951				0	uk	2*4*6*8* ... *n				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id2927335				0	uk	For odd numbers FACTDOUBLE(n) returns:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id2107303				0	uk	1*3*5*7* ... *n				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id4071779				0	uk	FACTDOUBLE(0) returns 1 by definition.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154622	42			0	uk	Example				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id7844477				0	uk	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=FACTDOUBLE(5)\</item\> returns 15.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3154116	43			0	uk	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=FACTDOUBLE(6)\</item\> returns 48.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id6478469				0	uk	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=FACTDOUBLE(0)\</item\> returns 1.				20220827 09:49:47
