helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153076	106			0	uk	Moves the cursor to the top edge of the current data range. If the row above the cell that contains the cursor is empty, the cursor moves up to the next row that contains data.				20220827 09:49:47
