helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\html_doc.xhp	0	help	par_id3150199	18			0	uk	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01070000.xhp\" name=\"File - Save As\"\>File - Save As\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	 Importing and Exporting CSV Files 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	bm_id892361				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>number series import\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>data series import\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>exporting; tables as text\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>importing; tables as text\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>delimited values and files\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>comma separated files and values\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>text file import and export\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>csv files;importing and exporting\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>tables; importing/exporting as text\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>text documents; importing to spreadsheets\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>opening;text csv files\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>saving;as text csv\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10862				0	uk	\<variable id=\"csv_files\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/csv_files.xhp\"\>Opening and Saving Text CSV Files\</link\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10880				0	uk	Comma Separated Values (CSV) is a text file format that you can use to exchange data from a database or a spreadsheet between applications. Each line in a Text CSV file represents a record in the database, or a row in a spreadsheet. Each field in a database record or cell in a spreadsheet row is usually separated by a comma. However, you can use other characters to delimit a field, such as a tabulator character.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10886				0	uk	If the field or cell contains a comma, the field or cell \<emph\>must\</emph\> be enclosed by single quotes (') or double quotes (").				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10890				0	uk	To Open a Text CSV File in Calc				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10897				0	uk	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File - Open\</item\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN1089F				0	uk	Locate the CSV file that you want to open.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN108A2				0	uk	If the file has a *.csv extension, select the file.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN108A5				0	uk	If the CSV file has another extension, select the file, and then select "Text CSV" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File type\</item\> box				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN1082D				0	uk	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Open\</item\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10834				0	uk	The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Text Import\</item\> dialog opens.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN108B1				0	uk	Specify the options to divide the text in the file into columns.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN108BB				0	uk	You can preview the layout of the imported data at the bottom of the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Text Import\</item\> dialog. 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_id8444166				0	uk	Right-click a column in the preview to set the format or to hide the column.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN108E2				0	uk	Check the text delimiter box that matches the character used as text delimiter in the file. In case of an unlisted delimiter, type the character into the input box.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN108C5				0	uk	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN108FA				0	uk	To Save a Sheet as a Text CSV File				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN106FC				0	uk	When you export a spreadsheet to CSV format, only the data on the current sheet is saved. All other information, including formulas and formatting, is lost.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10901				0	uk	Open the Calc sheet that you want to save as a Text CSV file.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN107AF				0	uk	Only the current sheet can be exported.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10905				0	uk	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File - Save as\</item\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10915				0	uk	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File name\</item\> box, enter a name for the file.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN1090D				0	uk	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File type\</item\> box, select "Text CSV".				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN107DD				0	uk	(Optional) Set the field options for the Text CSV file.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN1091C				0	uk	Select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit filter settings\</item\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN107ED				0	uk	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Export of text files\</item\> dialog, select the options that you want.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN107F4				0	uk	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN107FC				0	uk	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Save\</item\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_id3153487	20			0	uk	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060100.xhp\" name=\"Spreadsheet - View\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Calc - View\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
