helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_deletetable.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153726	31			0	uk	\<variable id=\"datapilot_deletetable\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/datapilot_deletetable.xhp\" name=\"Deleting Pivot Tables\"\>Deleting Pivot Tables\</link\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_deletetable.xhp	0	help	par_id3154014	32			0	uk	In order to delete a pivot table, click any cell in the pivot table, then choose \<emph\>Delete\</emph\> in the context menu.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autofilter.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Applying AutoFilter				20220827 09:49:47
