helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154319	11			0	uk	In a text box that has a button to minimize the dialog, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>F2\</item\> to enter the cell selection mode. Select any number of cells, then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>F2\</item\> again to show the dialog.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145272	10			0	uk	In the cell selection mode, you can use the common navigation keys to select cells.				20220827 09:49:47
