helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rounding_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3154321	5			0	uk	Mark all the cells you want to modify.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rounding_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3147428	6			0	uk	Choose \<emph\>Format - Cells\</emph\> and go to the \<emph\>Numbers\</emph\> tab page.				20220827 09:49:47
