helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id9947508				0	uk	In the dialog, click the \<emph\>Borders\</emph\> tab.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id7907956				0	uk	Choose the border options you want to apply and click OK.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id1342204				0	uk	The options in the \<emph\>Line arrangement\</emph\> area can be used to apply multiple border styles.				20220827 09:49:47
