helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05080000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149670	1			0	uk	Chart Area				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3125864	2			0	uk	\<variable id=\"diagrammflaeche\"\>\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\".uno:DiagramArea\"\>Opens the\<emph\> Chart Area\</emph\> dialog, where you can modify the properties of the chart area. The chart area is the background behind all elements of the chart.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
