helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040202.xhp	0	help	par_id3146885	74			0	uk	This area is used to define the marking dashes between the axis marks. It is possible to activate both fields. This will result in a marking line running from the outside to the inside.				20220827 09:49:47
