helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	par_id3146978	33			0	uk	Unlike groups, a combined object takes on the properties of the lowermost object in the stacking order. You can split apart combined objects, but the original object properties are lost.				20220827 09:49:47
