helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154926	7			0	uk	Default fonts				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	par_id3151262	8			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:DLG_ASCII_FILTER:LB_FONT\"\>By setting a default font, you specify that the text should be displayed in a specific font. The default fonts can only be selected when importing.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154894	9			0	uk	Language				20220827 09:49:47
