helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Showing and Hiding Docked Windows				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3085157	1			0	uk	Showing and Hiding Docked Windows				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149948	2			0	uk	Every \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#andocken\" name=\"docked\"\>docked\</link\> window has an icon to control the display properties of the window.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150502	3			0	uk	To show or hide a docked window, click the icon.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150465	13			0	uk	AutoShow and AutoHide Docked Windows				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155504	14			0	uk	You can click the edge of a hidden docked window to open the window.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153257	15			0	uk	The docked window closes automatically when you move the mouse pointer outside of the window.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154046	16			0	uk	Multiple docked windows act as a single window in AutoShow/AutoHide mode.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145416	18			0	uk	Drag and Drop				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149578	19			0	uk	If you drag an object over the edge of a hidden docked window, the window opens in AutoShow mode.				20220827 09:49:47
