helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06200000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148826	27			0	uk	Conversion				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159157	28			0	uk	Normally in a mixed text selection made of Hangul and Hanja characters, all Hangul characters will be converted to Hanja and all Hanja characters will be converted to Hangul. If you want to convert a mixed text selection only in one direction, use the following conversion options.				20220827 09:49:47
