helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149456	8			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR:EDIT:RID_OFAPAGE_AUTOCORR_REPLACE:ED_REPLACE\"\>Enter the replacement text, graphic, frame, or OLE object that you want to replace the text in the\<emph\> Replace\</emph\> box. If you have selected text, a graphic, a frame, or an OLE object in your document, the relevant information is already entered here.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
