helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id1481063				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select or enter the name of a binding. Selecting the name of an existing binding associates the binding with the form control. Entering a new name creates a new binding and associates it with the form control.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	hd_id7921079				0	uk	Binding expression				20220827 09:49:47
