helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030500.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A3E				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"svx:CheckBox:RID_SVXPAGE_BORDER:CB_MERGEWITHNEXT\"\>Merges the border style and the shadow style of the current paragraph with the next paragraph.\</ahelp\> These styles are only merged if the indent, border, and shadow styles of the next paragraph are the same as the current paragraph. This option is also available for Paragraph Styles.				20220827 09:49:47
