helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	hd_id2796411				0	uk	PDF/A-1a				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_id5016327				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Converts to the PDF/A-1a format. This is defined as an electronic document file format for long term preservation. All fonts that were used in the source document will be embedded into the generated PDF file. PDF tags will be written.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A0				0	uk	Tagged PDF				20220827 09:49:47
