helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B3				0	uk	Tagged PDF contains information about the structure of the document contents. This can help to display the document on devices with different screens, and when using screen reader software.				20220827 09:49:47
