helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_id0901200811454970				0	uk	Select the format of the data that you will receive from the submitter: FDF (Forms Data Format), PDF, HTML, or XML.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_idN10807				0	uk	This setting overrides the control's URL property that you set in the document.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	hd_id1026200909535841				0	uk	Allow duplicate field names				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_id102620090953596				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Allows to use the same field name for multiple fields in the generated PDF file. If disabled, field names will be exported using generated unique names.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	hd_id3946958				0	uk	Export automatically inserted blank pages				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_id8551896				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>If switched on, automatically inserted blank pages are being exported to pdf file. This is best if you are printing the pdf file double-sided. Example: In a book a chapter paragraph style is set to always start with an odd numbered page. The previous chapter ends on an odd page. %PRODUCTNAME inserts an even numbered blank page. This option controls whether to export that even numbered page or not.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	hd_id3954548				0	uk	Embed standard fonts				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_id853434896				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Normally the 14 standard PostScript fonts are not embedded in a PDF file, because every PDF reader software already contains these fonts. Enable this option to embed the standard fonts that are installed on your system and that are used in the document.\</ahelp\> Use this option if you expect to have a better looking or more useful standard font than the font that is available in the recipients' PDF reader software.				20220827 09:49:47
