helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06140400.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D2				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select the location where to load the configuration and where to save it.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06140400.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D5				0	uk	For every entry in the list box, an own configuration is maintained. Select one of the open documents or select the application to load and edit the associated configuration. Edit the configuration and save it back to the location from where you loaded it. Editing the configuration in one location does not change the configuration in any other location.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06140400.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D8				0	uk	It is not possible to load a configuration from one location and save it to another location.				20220827 09:49:47
