helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153779	24			0	uk	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>For example, to list all of the text files in a directory, enter the asterisk wildcard with the text file extension (*.txt), and then click\<emph\> Open\</emph\>. Use the question mark (?) wildcard to represent any character, as in (??3*.txt), which only displays text files with a '3' as the third character in the file name.\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				20220827 09:49:47
