helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010600.xhp	0	help	par_idN10579				0	uk	Traditional Chinese to Simplified Chinese				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010600.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057D				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Converts traditional Chinese text characters to simplified Chinese text characters. Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to convert the selected text. If no text is selected, the whole document is converted.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
