helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0818200912284914				0	uk	Preview				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id081820091228505				0	uk	The preview shows how each sheet of paper will look. You can browse through all sheets of paper with the buttons below the preview.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0818200912285056				0	uk	General				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912285064				0	uk	On the General tab page, you find the most important control elements for printing. You can define which contents of your document are to be printed. You can select the printer and open the printer settings dialog.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id2				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether to print colors and objects that are inserted to the background of the page (Format - Page - Background).\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id4				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether the graphics and drawings or OLE objects of your text document are printed.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
