helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912285150				0	uk	The Page Layout tab page can be used to save some sheets of paper by printing several pages onto each sheet of paper. You define the arrangement and size of output pages on the physical paper.				20220827 09:49:47
