helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id702230				0	uk	You can disable or enable the automatic check in \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/online_update.xhp\"\>Online Update\</link\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3422345				0	uk	If an update is available, an icon\<image id=\"img_id3155415\" src=\"extensions/source/update/ui/onlineupdate_16.png\" width=\"0.4583in\" height=\"0.1354in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155415\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> on the menu bar will notify you of the update. Click the icon to open a dialog with more information.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id9313638				0	uk	You will see the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/online_update_dialog.xhp\"\>Check for Updates\</link\> dialog with some information about the online update of %PRODUCTNAME.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id9951780				0	uk	Enable an Internet connection for %PRODUCTNAME.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id6479384				0	uk	If you need a proxy server, enter the proxy settings in \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Internet - Proxy.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3639027				0	uk	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Check for Updates\</item\> to check for the availability of a newer version of your office suite.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3722342				0	uk	If a newer version is available and %PRODUCTNAME is not set up for automatic downloading, then you can select any of the following actions:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id5106662				0	uk	Download the new version.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id4931485				0	uk	Install the downloaded files.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id9168980				0	uk	Abort this check for updates for now.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id9766533				0	uk	If %PRODUCTNAME is configured to download the files automatically, the download starts immediately. A download continues even when you minimize the dialog.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id927152				0	uk	If automatic downloads are disabled, start the download manually.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id6081728				0	uk	If no update was found, you can close the dialog.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id9219641				0	uk	You need Administrator rights to update %PRODUCTNAME.				20220827 09:49:47
