helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02210101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149031	2			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2:TABPAGE:TP_FRAMEPROPERTIES\"\>Changes the properties of the selected floating frame. Floating frames work best when they contain an html document, and when they are inserted in another html document.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
