helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05260300.xhp	0	help	par_id3147069	2			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Anchors the selected item to a character.\</ahelp\> This command is only available for graphic objects.				20220827 09:49:47
