helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149119	2			0	uk	\<variable id=\"litdattext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"HID_BIB_DB_TBX\"\>Insert, delete, edit, and organize records in the bibliography database.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346	53			0	uk	If the fields in your database are read-only, ensure that the data source view is closed.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150506	41			0	uk	The supplied bibliography database contains sample records of books.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155356	4			0	uk	Use the toolbar to select a table in the bibliography database, to search for records, or to sort the records using filters.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3163802	21			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Lists the available tables in the current database. Click a name in the list to display the records for that table.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
