helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157960	31			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Type the number of the record that you want to display, and then press Enter.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150868	5			0	uk	Inserting a New Record				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149168	6			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GRID_TRAVEL_NEW\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts a new record into the current table.\</ahelp\>To create a record, click the asterisk (*) button at the bottom of the table view. An empty row is added at the end of the table.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152920	7			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select the type of record that you want to create. $[officename] inserts a number in the \<emph\>Type\</emph\> column of the record that corresponds to the type that you select here.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156423	32			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter a short name for the record. The short name appears in the \<emph\>Identifier\</emph\> column in the list of records.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155994	8			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter additional information for the selected record. If you want, you can also enter the information in the corresponding field in the table.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163716	9			0	uk	Finding and Filtering Records				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147478	10			0	uk	You can search for records by matching a keyword to a field entry.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159181	28			0	uk	Entering Search key				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159125	11			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Bib/query\"\>Type the information that you want to search for, and then press Enter. To change the filter options for the search, long-click the \<emph\>AutoFilter\</emph\> icon, and then select a different data field. You can use wildcards such as % or * for any number of characters, and _ or ? for one character in your search. To display all of the records in the table, clear this box, and then press Enter. \</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155511	29			0	uk	AutoFilter				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975	14			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Bib/autoFilter\"\>Long-click to select the data field that you want to search using the term that you entered in the \<emph\>Search Key\</emph\> box. You can only search one data field.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149664	15			0	uk	The list of table records is automatically updated to match the new filter settings.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145590	30			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Use the \<emph\>Standard Filter\</emph\> to refine and to combine \<emph\>AutoFilter \</emph\>search options.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155311	16			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>To display all of the records in a table, click the \<emph\>Remove Filter\</emph\> icon.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147580	17			0	uk	Deleting a Record				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154471	18			0	uk	To delete a record in the current table, right-click the row header of the record, and then select \<emph\>Delete\</emph\>. \<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_DELETEROWS\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deletes the selected record.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
