helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3163829	2			0	uk	\<variable id=\"sortierentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:OrderCrit\"\>Specifies the sort criteria for the data display.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149549	12			0	uk	While the functions \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12010000.xhp\" name=\"Sort in Ascending Order\"\>\<emph\>Sort in Ascending Order\</emph\>\</link\> and \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12020000.xhp\" name=\"Sort in Descending Order\"\>\<emph\>Sort in Descending Order\</emph\>\</link\> sort by one criterion only, you can combine several criteria in the\<emph\> Sort Order \</emph\>dialog.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145136	13			0	uk	You can remove a sorting that has been performed with the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12040000.xhp\" name=\"Remove Filter/Sorting\"\>\<emph\>Remove Filter/Sorting\</emph\>\</link\> icon.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148548	4			0	uk	Sorting				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155941	5			0	uk	Use this area to enter sorting criteria. If you enter additional sorting criteria under \<emph\>and then\</emph\>, the data matching the content of the higher-order criterion is ordered according to the next criterion.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148620	14			0	uk	If you sort the field name "First name" in ascending order and the field name "last name" in descending order, all records will be sorted in ascending order by first name, and then within the first names, in descending order by last name.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145345	6			0	uk	Field name				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233	7			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:OrderCrit\"\>Specifies the data field name whose content will determine the sort order.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150774	8			0	uk	Order				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177	9			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:OrderCrit\"\>Specifies the sort order (either ascending or descending).\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
