helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146130	2			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:StatusSelectionMode\"\>Displays the current selection mode. You can switch between STD = Standard, EXT = Extend, ADD = Add, BLK = Block selection.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153894	3			0	uk	Each click in the field cycles through the available options:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394	4			0	uk	\<emph\>Display\</emph\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149095	5			0	uk	\<emph\>Mode\</emph\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155941	6			0	uk	\<emph\>Effect\</emph\>				20220827 09:49:47
