helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152780	8			0	uk	Standard mode				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147209	9			0	uk	Click in text where you want to position the cursor; click in a cell to make it the active cell. Any other selection is then deselected.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149763	10			0	uk	EXT				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149580	11			0	uk	Extension mode (F8)				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153717	12			0	uk	Clicking in the text extends or crops the current selection.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154047	13			0	uk	ADD				20220827 09:49:47
