helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154477	102			0	uk	The \<emph\>State\</emph\> line shows the records returned by the search. If the search reaches the end (or the beginning) of a table, the search is automatically continued at the other end.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3163720	103			0	uk	In very large databases, finding the record in reverse search order can take some time. In this case, the status bar informs you that the records are still being counted.				20220827 09:49:47
