helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156183	2			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Refresh\"\>Refreshes the displayed data.\</ahelp\> In a multi-user environment, refreshing the data ensures that it remains current.				20220827 09:49:47
