helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3109850	2			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SbaExecuteSql\"\>Runs the SQL query and displays the query result.\</ahelp\> The \<emph\>Run Query\</emph\> function does not save the query.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149893	5			0	uk	The\<emph\> Run Query \</emph\>function allows you to check the query. When you save the query, it is stored in the \<emph\>Query\</emph\> tab page.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14010000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10621				0	uk	Choose \<emph\>View - Preview\</emph\> to run the query from the menu bar of a query design window.				20220827 09:49:47
