helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151274	70			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DrawCaption\"\>Draws a line that ends in a rectangular callout with horizontal text direction from where you drag in the current document. Drag a handle of the callout to resize the callout. To add text, click the edge of the callout, and then type or paste your text. To change a rectangular callout to a rounded callout, drag the largest corner handle when the pointer changes to a hand.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10E50				0	uk	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05270000.xhp\" name=\"Points\"\>Points\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10E60				0	uk	Enables you to edit points on your drawing.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10E75				0	uk	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/04140000.xhp\" name=\"From File\"\>From File\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10E95				0	uk	\<link href=\"text/shared/3dsettings_toolbar.xhp\"\>Extrusion On/Off\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10EA5				0	uk	Switches the 3D effects on and off for the selected objects.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149735	75			0	uk	Vertical Callouts				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156068				0	uk	\<image id=\"img_id3154818\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_verticalcaption.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154818\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150492	76			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:VerticalCaption\"\>Draws a line that ends in a rectangular callout with vertical text direction from where you drag in the current document. Drag a handle of the callout to resize the callout. To add text, click the edge of the callout, and then type or paste your text. To change a rectangular callout to a rounded callout, drag the largest corner handle when the pointer changes to a hand. Only available when Asian language support is enabled.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166437	77			0	uk	Vertical Text				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146929				0	uk	\<image id=\"img_id3154372\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_verticaltext.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154372\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152989	78			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:VerticalText\"\>Draws a text box with vertical text direction where you click or drag in the current document. Click anywhere in the document, and then type or paste your text. You can also move the cursor to where you want to add the text, drag a text box, and then type or paste your text. Only available when Asian language support is enabled.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555	74			0	uk	\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/insert_graphic_drawit.xhp\" name=\"Tips\"\>Tips for working with the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar.\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
