helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146807	9			0	uk	Greater than (>)				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154852	10			0	uk	Shows values greater than the condition.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155342	11			0	uk	Less than or equal to (< =)				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154381	12			0	uk	Shows values that are less than or equal to the condition.				20220827 09:49:47
