helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154094	1			0	uk	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/09030000.xhp\" name=\"Hyperlink\"\>Hyperlink\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151100	2			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SetHyperlink\"\>Inserts a hyperlink from the current URL into your document.\</ahelp\> The \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#url\" name=\"URL\"\>URL\</link\> address is taken from the entry in the \<emph\>Internet URLs \</emph\>combo box, and the name of the link is taken from the \<emph\>URL Name\</emph\> combo box.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149760	3			0	uk	You can insert the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#hyperlink\" name=\"hyperlink\"\>hyperlink\</link\> as text or as a button. Click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Hyperlink\</emph\> icon, then select \<emph\>As text\</emph\> or \<emph\>As button \</emph\>from the menu. The hyperlink is then inserted at the current cursor location.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	uk	\<image id=\"img_id3156426\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_chainframes.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156426\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20220827 09:49:47
