helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Close Window				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152895	1			0	uk	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/10100000.xhp\" name=\"Close Window\"\>Close Window\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934	2			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CloseWin\"\>Closes the current window.\</ahelp\> Choose \<emph\>Window - Close Window\</emph\>, or press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F4. In the page preview of $[officename] Writer and Calc, you can close the current window by clicking the \<emph\>Close Preview\</emph\> button.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147143	5			0	uk	If additional views of the current document were opened by \<emph\>Window - New Window\</emph\>, this command will close only the current view.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153910	6			0	uk	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01050000.xhp\" name=\"Close the current document\"\>Close the current document\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Events				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148643				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>controls; events\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>events; controls\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>macros; assigning to events in forms\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148643	1			0	uk	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170103.xhp\" name=\"Events\"\>Events\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3152350	2			0	uk	On the\<emph\> Events \</emph\>tab page you can link macros to events that occur in a form's control fields.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155419	40			0	uk	When the event occurs, the linked macro will be called. To assign a macro to an event, press the \<emph\>...\</emph\> button. An \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05060700.xhp\" name=\"Assign Macro\"\>Assign Macro\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>dialog\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> opens.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149732	3			0	uk	Depending on the control, different events are available. Only the available events for the selected control and context are listed on the \<emph\>Events\</emph\> tab page. The following events are defined:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149191	12			0	uk	Approve action				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153717	13			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_APPROVEACTIONPERFORMED\"\>This event takes place before an action is triggered by clicking the control.\</ahelp\> For example, clicking a "Submit" button initiates a send action; however, the actual "send" process is started only when the \<emph\>When initiating\</emph\> event occurs. The \<emph\>Approve action\</emph\> event allows you to kill the process. If the linked method sends back FALSE, \<emph\>When initiating\</emph\> will not be executed.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156024	36			0	uk	Execute action				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3145609	37			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_ACTIONPERFORMED\"\>The \<emph\>Execute action\</emph\> event occurs when an action is started.\</ahelp\> For example, if you have a "Submit" button in your form, the send process represents the action to be initiated.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156343	41			0	uk	Changed				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148755	42			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_CHANGED\"\>The\<emph\> Changed \</emph\>event takes place when the control loses the focus and the content of the control has changed since it lost the focus.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153524	10			0	uk	Text modified				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150495	11			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_TEXTCHANGED\"\>The\<emph\> Text modified \</emph\>event takes place if you enter or modify a text in an input field.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154123	8			0	uk	Item status changed				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150870	9			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_ITEMSTATECHANGED\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The\<emph\> Item status changed \</emph\>event takes place if the status of the control field has changed.\</ahelp\>The\<emph\> Item status changed\</emph\> event takes place if he status of the control field has changed.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151176	16			0	uk	When receiving focus				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3154218	17			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_FOCUSGAINED\"\>The\<emph\> When receiving focus \</emph\>event takes place if a control field receives the focus.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150447	18			0	uk	When losing focus				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3159252	19			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_FOCUSLOST\"\>The\<emph\> When losing focus \</emph\>event takes place if a control field looses the focus.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147287	20			0	uk	Key pressed				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3152940	21			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_KEYTYPED\"\>The \<emph\>Key pressed \</emph\>event occurs when the user presses any key while the control has the focus.\</ahelp\> This event may be linked to a macro for checking entries.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154127	43			0	uk	Key released				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3154150	44			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_KEYUP\"\>The\<emph\> Key released \</emph\>event occurs when the user releases any key while the control has the focus.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154921	26			0	uk	Mouse inside				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148618	27			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEENTERED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse inside \</emph\>event takes place if the mouse is inside the control field.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148576	30			0	uk	Mouse moved while key pressed				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411	31			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEDRAGGED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse moved while key pressed \</emph\>event takes place when the mouse is dragged while a key is pressed.\</ahelp\> An example is when, during drag-and-drop, an additional key determines the mode (move or copy).				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149262	32			0	uk	Mouse moved				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975	33			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEMOVED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse moved \</emph\>event occurs if the mouse moves over the control.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159197	22			0	uk	Mouse button pressed				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3145271	23			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEPRESSED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse button pressed \</emph\>event occurs if the mouse button is pressed while the mouse pointer is on the control.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_idN108BD				0	uk	Note that this event is also used for notifying requests for a popup context menu on the control.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148880	24			0	uk	Mouse button released				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150659	25			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSERELEASED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse button released \</emph\>event occurs if the mouse button is released while the mouse pointer is on the control.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156286	28			0	uk	Mouse outside				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149582	29			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEEXITED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse outside \</emph\>event takes place when the mouse is outside the control field.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	General				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153681	1			0	uk	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"General\"\>General\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233	2			0	uk	This \<emph\>General \</emph\>tab enables you to define the general properties of a form control. These properties differ, depending on the control type. Not all of the following properties are available for every control.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155342	172			0	uk	If you export the current form document to HTML format, the default control values are exported, not the current control values. Default values are determined - depending on the type of control - by the properties' Default value (for example, in text fields), Default status (for check boxes and option fields), and Default selection (for list boxes).				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149734	13			0	uk	Enabled				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150084	14			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_ENABLED\"\>If a control field has the property "Enabled" (Yes), the form user will be able to use the control field.\</ahelp\> If the property is disabled, it will not be enabled (No) and will be displayed in a gray color.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153320	74			0	uk	Line count				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149235	75			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_LINECOUNT\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies how many lines should be displayed in the dropdown list. This setting is only active if you chose "Yes" in the "Dropdown" option.\</ahelp\>For combo boxes with the Dropdown property, you can specify how many lines should be displayed in the dropdown list. With control fields which do not have the Dropdown option, the line's display will be specified by the size of the control field and the font size.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153147	23			0	uk	Action				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149415	24			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_BUTTONTYPE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The Action property determines the action that occurs when you activate a button.\</ahelp\>You can use navigation actions to design your own database navigation buttons.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3152474	25			0	uk	The following table describes the actions that you can assign to a button.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147303	224			0	uk	Action				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154388	225			0	uk	Description				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154071	26			0	uk	None				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153797	27			0	uk	No action occurs.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154216	30			0	uk	Submit form				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147228	31			0	uk	Sends the data that is entered in other control fields of the current form to the address that is specified in \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170200.xhp\" name=\"Form Properties\"\>Form Properties\</link\> under \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170201.xhp\" name=\"URL\"\>\<emph\>URL\</emph\>\</link\>. 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN107F7				0	uk	Enter the URL into the form's data property "URL" text box when you export to a PDF file.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151041	28			0	uk	Reset form				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155101	29			0	uk	Resets the settings in other control fields to the predefined defaults (Default Status, Default Selection, Default Value).				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155431	32			0	uk	Open document / web page				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150010	33			0	uk	Opens the URL that is specified under \<emph\>URL\</emph\>. You can use \<emph\>Frame\</emph\> to specify the target frame.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN107FE				0	uk	First record				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN10803				0	uk	Moves the current form to the first record.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN10809				0	uk	Previous record				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1080E				0	uk	Moves the current form to the previous record.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN10814				0	uk	Next record				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN10819				0	uk	Moves the current form to the next record.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1081F				0	uk	Last record				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN10824				0	uk	Moves the current form to the last record.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1082A				0	uk	Save record				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1082F				0	uk	Saves the current record, if necessary.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN10835				0	uk	Undo data entry				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1083A				0	uk	Reverses the changes in the current record.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN10840				0	uk	New record				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN10845				0	uk	Moves the current form to the insert row.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1084B				0	uk	Delete record				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN10850				0	uk	Deletes the current record.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN10856				0	uk	Refresh form				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1085B				0	uk	Reloads the most recently saved version of the current form.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154638	19			0	uk	Dropdown				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3152577	20			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_DROPDOWN\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether the combo box should dropdown (Yes) or not (No).\</ahelp\>A control field with the dropdown property has an additional arrow button which opens the list of the existing form entries per mouse click. Under \<emph\>Line count\</emph\>, you can specify how many lines (or rows) should be displayed in the dropdown state. Combination fields can have the dropdown property.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159198	182			0	uk	Combo boxes that were inserted as columns in a table control are always dropdown as the default.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153140	11			0	uk	Alignment / Graphics alignment				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151281	12			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_ALIGN\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies the alignment option for text or graphics that are used on a control.\</ahelp\>The alignment options are left-aligned, right-aligned, and centered. These options are available for the following elements:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN109DD				0	uk	Title of Label fields				20220827 09:49:47
