helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148527	21			0	uk	Text type				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153724	22			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"37933\"\>Allows you to use line breaks and formatting in a control field, such as a text box or label. To manually enter a line break, press the Enter key. Select "Multi-line with formatting" to enter formatted text.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN113D2				0	uk	If you select the text type "Multi-line with formatting", you cannot bind this control to a database field.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11391				0	uk	This control is named "Multiline input" for a text column inside a table control.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN114EF				0	uk	Word break				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11505				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays text on more than one line.\</ahelp\> Allows you to use line breaks in a text box, so that you can enter more than one line of text. To manually enter a line break, press the Enter key.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11538				0	uk	Toggle				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1154E				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies if a Push Button behaves as a Toggle Button. If you set Toggle to "Yes", you can switch between the "selected" and "not selected" control states when you click the button or press the spacebar while the control has the focus. A button in the "selected" state appears "pressed in".\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11558				0	uk	Take Focus on Click				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1156E				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>If you set this option to "Yes", the Push Button receives the focus when you click the button.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11578				0	uk	Hide selection				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1158E				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"37965\"\>Specifies whether a text selection on a control remains selected when a the focus is no longer on a control.\</ahelp\> If you set \<emph\>Hide selection\</emph\> to "No", the selected text remains selected when the focus is no longer on the control that contains the text.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11598				0	uk	Style				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN115AE				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"37966\"\>Specifies whether Check boxes and Option buttons are displayed in a 3D look (default) or a flat look.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN115B8				0	uk	Border color				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN115CE				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"37967\"\>Specifies the border color for controls that have the Border property set to "flat".\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
