helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149242	201			0	uk	For a reset type button, you can define the status of the control if the reset button is activated by the user.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3156266	202			0	uk	For grouped option fields, the status of the group corresponding to the default setting is defined by the \<emph\>Default Status\</emph\> property.				20220827 09:49:47
