helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147576	5			0	uk	To make changes in a database used by more than one person, you must have the appropriate access rights. When you edit an external database, there is no intermediate storage by $[officename] of the changes made. They are sent directly to the database.				20220827 09:49:47
