helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170801.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Table Element / List Box / Combo Box Wizard: Data				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170801.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153323	3			0	uk	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170801.xhp\" name=\"Table Element / List Box / Combo Box Wizard: Data\"\>Table Element / List Box / Combo Box Wizard: Data\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170801.xhp	0	help	par_id3150476	4			0	uk	Select the data source and table to which the form field corresponds. If you insert the form field in a document that is already linked to a data source, this page becomes invisible.				20220827 09:49:47
