helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10922				0	uk	Help Page				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10926				0	uk	You can copy from the Help Viewer to the clipboard on your operating system with standard copy commands. For example:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN1092C				0	uk	On a Help page, select the text that you want to copy.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10930				0	uk	Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+C.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10933				0	uk	To search the current Help page:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10939				0	uk	Click the \<emph\>Find on this Page\</emph\> icon.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10940				0	uk	The \<emph\>Find on this Page\</emph\> dialog opens.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A36				0	uk	You can also click in the Help page and press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A22				0	uk	In the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> box, enter the text that you want to find.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A48				0	uk	Select the search options that you want to use.				20220827 09:49:47
