helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149202	8			0	uk	Navigation Pane				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3148673	9			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TABCONTROL\"\>The navigation pane of the Help window contains the tab pages \<emph\>Contents\</emph\>, \<emph\>Index\</emph\>, \<emph\>Find\</emph\> and \<emph\>Bookmarks\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3159149	19			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_LISTBOX\"\>The list box located at the very top is where you can select other \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Help modules.\</ahelp\> The \<emph\>Index\</emph\> and \<emph\>Find\</emph\> tab pages only contain the data for the selected \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> module.				20220827 09:49:47
