helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345	4			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_LISTBOX_TP_HELP_BOOKMARKS_LB_BOOKMARKS\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Double-clicking a bookmark or pressing the Return key opens the assigned page in Help. A right-click opens the context menu.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
