helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154962	8			0	uk	Icons in the Documentation				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3146961	9			0	uk	There are three icons used to call your attention to additional helpful information.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3156152	10			0	uk	The "Important!" icon points out important information regarding data and system security.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153897	11			0	uk	The "Note" icon points out extra information: for example, alternative ways to reach a certain goal.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154216	12			0	uk	The "Tip" icon points out tips for working with the program in a more efficient manner.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Help Agent, Tips and Extended Tips				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150672				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>Help; Help tips\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tooltips; help\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>Help Agent; help\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>Clippy, see Help Agent\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155599	1			0	uk	\<variable id=\"00000120\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000120.xhp\" name=\"Help Agent, Tips and Extended Tips\"\>Help Agent, Tips and Extended Tips\</link\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3148520	2			0	uk	The Help Agent, Tips, and Extended Tips provide help while you work. 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147285	7			0	uk	The Help Agent				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3149716	8			0	uk	The \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010600.xhp\" name=\"Help Agent\"\>Help Agent\</link\> starts automatically when you are performing a task that might require some assistance. The Help Agent appears in a small window in a corner of the document. To view the help for the task, click inside the Help Agent window.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_idN10634				0	uk	The Help Agent automatically closes after a short delay. If you ignore or close the Help Agent three times you perform a certain task, the Help Agent no longer opens for that task. To disable the Help Agent choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149140	3			0	uk	Tips				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3157896	4			0	uk	Tips provide you with the names of toolbar buttons. To display a tip, rest the pointer over a toolbar button until the name of the button appears.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3153910	9			0	uk	Tips are also displayed for some elements in a document, such as chapter names when you scroll through a long document.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id992156				0	uk	Enable or disable the tips on \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147571	5			0	uk	Extended Tips				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346	6			0	uk	Extended tips provide a brief description about buttons and commands. To display an extended tip, press Shift+F1, then point to a button or command.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_idN10666				0	uk	If you always want extended tips instead of tips, enable the extended tips on \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Index - Keyword Search in the Help				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149428				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>Index tab in Help\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Help; keywords\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153884	5			0	uk	\<variable id=\"00000130\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000130.xhp\" name=\"Index - Keyword Search in the Help\"\>Index - Keyword Search in the Help\</link\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3150960	3			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_COMBOBOX_TP_HELP_INDEX_CB_INDEX\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Double-click an entry or type the word you want to find in the index.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3148668	8			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_PUSHBUTTON_TP_HELP_INDEX_PB_OPEN_INDEX\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click to display the selected topic.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934	1			0	uk	You can search for a specific topic by typing a word into the \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text box. The window contains an alphabetical list of index terms.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3145669	6			0	uk	If the cursor is in the index list when you type the search term, the display will jump directly to the next match. When you type a word in the \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text box, the focus will jump to the best match in the index list.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3147653	7			0	uk	The index and full-text searches always apply to the currently selected \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> application. Select the appropriate application using the list box on the help viewer's toolbar.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Getting Support				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	bm_id3143272				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>support on the Web\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>getting support\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>forums and support\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>Web support\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146873	1			0	uk	\<variable id=\"00000001\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000001.xhp\" name=\"Getting Support\"\>Getting Support\</link\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id9173253				0	uk	Many questions and answers are the same for %PRODUCTNAME software and for the commercial office software.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150667	8			0	uk	You can find support on the %PRODUCTNAME website at \<link href=\"https://support.openoffice.org\"\>support.openoffice.org\</link\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154230	3			0	uk	For a summary of the current support services refer to the \<emph\>Readme\</emph\> file in the \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> folder.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id26327				0	uk	Local language support pages				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id1318380				0	uk	The %PRODUCTNAME localization projects offer support pages in local languages. Find an overview of the native language projects at \<link href=\"https://projects.openoffice.org/native-lang.html\"\>projects.openoffice.org/native-lang.html\</link\>. You can find help and support in English language on the %PRODUCTNAME website at \<link href=\"https://support.openoffice.org\"\>support.openoffice.org\</link\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id2611386				0	uk	Mailing lists				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3166335				0	uk	Ask about %PRODUCTNAME, find help by volunteers, and discuss topics on the public mailing lists. You can find many general and specialized mailing lists on the %PRODUCTNAME website at \<link href=\"https://www.openoffice.org/mail_list.html\"\>www.openoffice.org/mail_list.html\</link\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id0915200811081722				0	uk	Forum				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0915200811081778				0	uk	You can access web forums to ask and answer questions about %PRODUCTNAME.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id0804200803314150				0	uk	Security				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0804200803314235				0	uk	In case you are concerned about any security issue with using this software, please refer to the \<link href=\"https://www.openoffice.org/security/index.html\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Security\</link\> page on our website.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3168534				0	uk	Downloads				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3028143				0	uk	You can download the latest version of %PRODUCTNAME at \<link href=\"https://download.openoffice.org/\"\>download.openoffice.org\</link\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id2602967				0	uk	Documentation				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3497211				0	uk	You can download documentation as PDF files, how-tos, and guides from the %PRODUCTNAME website at \<link href=\"https://documentation.openoffice.org\"\>documentation.openoffice.org\</link\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id0120200910361765				0	uk	Participate and give back				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0120200910361848				0	uk	If you want to take an active role in the worldwide %PRODUCTNAME community, you are very welcome to give feedback, discuss features, propose enhancements, write your own article in an FAQ, how-to, manual, create a video tutorial, etc.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0120200910361874				0	uk	Visit the \<link href=\"https://documentation.openoffice.org/\"\>documentation web site\</link\> or the \<link href=\"https://wiki.openoffice.org/wiki/Documentation\"\>Wiki starting page\</link\> and follow the links for contributors.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\07\09000000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Веб-сторінки				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\07\09000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156014	1			0	uk	\<link href=\"text/shared/07/09000000.xhp\" name=\"Веб-сторінки\"\>Веб-сторінки\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\07\09000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146946	2			0	uk	Щоб творити у Інтернет нову веб-сторінку, відкрийте новий \<emph\>документ HTML\</emph\> за допомогою команди меню \<emph\>Файл - Створити\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\07\09000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143284	3			0	uk	Для відкриття засобу створення веб-сторінок "Режим веб-сторінки" треба вибрати команду меню \<emph\>Вигляд - Режим веб-сторінки\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\07\09000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147285	8			0	uk	Створення нової веб-сторінки				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\07\09000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150808	9			0	uk	Перемкніться у режим веб-сторінки за допомогою \<emph\>Вигляд - Режим веб-стоірнки\</emph\> відкриттям нового HTML документа.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\07\09000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145136	15			0	uk	Для створення HTML-сторінки з документу $[officename] збережіть сторінку, використовуючи один з типів файла "Документ HTML".				20220827 09:49:47
