helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01010000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Letter Wizard				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01010000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151100				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>wizards; letters\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Letter Wizard\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>templates;letters\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151100	1			0	uk	Letter Wizard				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3093440	2			0	uk	\<variable id=\"brief\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AutoPilotLetter\"\>Starts the wizard for a letter template.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> You can use this template for both business and personal correspondence.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149178	3			0	uk	$[officename] comes with sample templates for personal or business letters, which you can customize to your own needs with the help of the wizard. The wizard leads you step-by-step in creating a document template and offers numerous layout and design options. The preview gives you an impression of how the finished letter will appear according to the settings you choose.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153748	4			0	uk	Within the wizard, you can modify your entries and options at any time. You may also skip an entire page or even all the wizard pages, in which case the current (or default) settings will remain in effect.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153824	5			0	uk	If you are creating a business letter, you can select a variety of elements to include in your document, which usually do not apply to personal letters, such as a subject line. If you choose the \<emph\>Personal\</emph\> letter option, some pages which contain elements specific to business letters will not be included in the wizard dialog.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159176	6			0	uk	Back				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153543	7			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_LTRWIZARD_BACK\"\>Allows you to view the selections that you made on the previous steps.\</ahelp\> The current settings will be saved. 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150254	8			0	uk	Next				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155923	9			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_LTRWIZARD_NEXT\"\>Saves the current settings and continues to the next page.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148944	10			0	uk	Finish				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669	11			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_LTRWIZARD_CREATE\"\>According to your selections, the wizard creates a new document template and saves it on your hard disk.\</ahelp\> $[officename] creates a new document based on the existing templates with the "Untitled X" name (X stands for the consecutive numbering) and displays it on the work area.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3144433	16			0	uk	$[officename] saves the current settings in the wizard according to the chosen template. These settings are used as the default settings the next time you activate the wizard.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01090400.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Form Wizard - Set Data Entry				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10543				0	uk	\<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01090400.xhp\"\>Form Wizard - Set Data Entry\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10553				0	uk	Specifies the data handling mode for the new form.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10558				0	uk	The form is to be used for entering new data only. Existing data will not be displayed				20220827 09:49:47
