helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard00.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Web Wizard				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard00.xhp	0	help	par_idN1054D				0	uk	\<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/webwizard00.xhp\"\>Web Wizard\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard00.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055D				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"34200\"\>The Web Wizard helps you to maintain a web site on an Internet server.\</ahelp\> The Web Wizard converts files in a local folder to a web format and uploads the files to the server. The wizard also uses one of the supplied templates to create an index page that contains hyperlinks to the uploaded files.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard00.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C4				0	uk	The Web Wizard uses the File Transfer Protocol (FTP) to upload files to a server. You cannot use the wizard to upload the files if you connect to the internet through a proxy server.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard00.xhp	0	help	par_idN10574				0	uk	The wizard involves the following steps:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard02.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Web Wizard - Documents				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard02.xhp	0	help	par_idN10547				0	uk	\<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/webwizard02.xhp\"\>Web Wizard - Documents\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard02.xhp	0	help	par_idN10557				0	uk	Select the files that you want to upload to your web site. You can upload the files to a server or to a local directory.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard02.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055A				0	uk	Documents				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard02.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055E				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"34210\"\>Lists the documents that you want to publish to your web site. The wizard can convert %PRODUCTNAME documents to HTML, PDF, or, in some cases, Flash format before the documents are uploaded. All other files are uploaded in their original file format.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard02.xhp	0	help	par_idN10561				0	uk	Add				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard02.xhp	0	help	par_idN10565				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"34211\"\>Opens a dialog where you can select the files that you want to upload to your web site. The order of the list determines the order in which the hyperlinks to the documents are displayed on the index page of your web site.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard02.xhp	0	help	par_idN10568				0	uk	Remove				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard02.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056C				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"34212\"\>Removes the selected file from the list.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard02.xhp	0	help	par_idN10577				0	uk	Export to file format				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard02.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057B				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"34218\"\>Select the file format that you want to export the selected file to.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard02.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057E				0	uk	Title				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard02.xhp	0	help	par_idN10582				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"34215\"\>Enter the title for the selected document. The title appears as a hyperlink to the selected document on the index page of your web site.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard02.xhp	0	help	par_idN10585				0	uk	Summary				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard02.xhp	0	help	par_idN10589				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"34216\"\>Enter a description for the selected document.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard02.xhp	0	help	par_idN1058C				0	uk	Author				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard02.xhp	0	help	par_idN10590				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"34217\"\>Enter the name of the author for the selected document.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
