helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154094	11			0	uk	The default settings will be accepted if you open the form in the user mode. With these settings you determine the control property \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Default Status\"\>Default Status\</link\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157896	3			0	uk	Should one option field be selected as a default?				20220827 09:49:47
