helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147226	5			0	uk	Yes, the following:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774	10			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_RADIOBUTTON_RID_PAGE_DEFAULTFIELDSELECTION_RB_DEFSELECTION_YES\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies that you want an option field to be selected as a default after opening the form.\</ahelp\> Choose the option field from the box.				20220827 09:49:47
