helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard01.xhp	0	help	par_idN10554				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>You can use the Web Wizard to maintain web pages on a server.\</ahelp\> You can also load previously saved Web Wizard settings to maintain an existing web page. These settings include information about the local folder and the FTP server.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard01.xhp	0	help	par_idN10557				0	uk	Choose Web Wizard settings				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard01.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055B				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"34207\"\>Select the settings that you want to load and then click \<emph\>Load\</emph\>. To start the wizard with the default settings, select "default".\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
