helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3163829	2			0	uk	On the first page you can select an existing design or create a new one.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363	14			0	uk	The settings you select for the export will be automatically saved as a design for other exports. You can enter the design name after clicking \<emph\>Create\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151226	12			0	uk	Assign design				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152801	13			0	uk	In this area, you can choose to create a new design and select or delete an existing design.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147291	3			0	uk	If you delete a design, you will only delete the design information in the Wizard. An export file will not be deleted by this action.				20220827 09:49:47
