helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10566				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The Start-up Wizard helps you to specify the user settings for %PRODUCTNAME. This wizard only runs once.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
