helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10579				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Read and accept the license text to continue. You need to scroll to the end of the license text before you can continue. If you decline the license, the installation is canceled.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
