helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	par_id6684163				0	uk	If this control box is not enabled, then the forms in the current database will not be checked for required fields.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	par_id3837397				0	uk	The control box is available for all data source types which support write access to their data. The control box does not exist for spreadsheets, text, csv, and the various read-only address books.				20220827 09:49:47
