helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154288	2			0	uk	\<variable id=\"sqltext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens a dialog where you can enter an SQL command for administering a database.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147275	23			0	uk	You can only enter administration commands in this dialog, such as Grant, Create Table, or Drop Table, and not filter commands. The commands that you can enter depend on the data source, for example, dBASE can only run some of the SQL commands list here.				20220827 09:49:47
