helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154938	16			0	uk	As soon as you change a detail of the current index and then select another index, the change is immediately passed to the data source. You can only leave the dialog, or select another index, if the change has been successfully acknowledged by the data source. However, you can undo the change by clicking the \<emph\>Reset Current Index \</emph\>icon.				20220827 09:49:47
