helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id9141819				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>If Deep traversing is enabled, functions are evaluated considering all lower levels of hierarchy. This would be used for instance for line numbering. If Deep traversing is not enabled, only the first level of hierarchy is evaluated.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
