helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147045	39			0	uk	Choose \<emph\>File - New - Database\</emph\> to open the Database Wizard.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147394	98			0	uk	Click \<emph\>Connect to an existing database\</emph\>, and then select "Adabas" in the listbox (scroll up in the listbox).				20220827 09:49:47
