helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id5857112				0	uk	To insert an additional \<emph\>Report Header\</emph\> and \<emph\>Report Footer\</emph\> area choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit - Insert Report Header/Footer\</item\>. These areas contain text that appears at the start and end of the whole report.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id6042664				0	uk	Click the "-" icon in front of an area name to collapse that area to one line in the Report Builder view. The "-" icon changes to a "+" icon, and you can click this to expand the area again.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id1589098				0	uk	You insert database fields by drag-and-drop into the Detail area. See the section "To insert fields into the report" below.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id1278420				0	uk	In addition, you can click the Label Field or Text Box icon in the toolbar, then drag a rectangle in the Page Header or Page Footer area, to define a text that is the same on all pages. You enter the text in the Label box of the corresponding Properties window. You can also add graphics by using the Graphics icon.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id7479476				0	uk	To connect the report to a database table				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id3099154				0	uk	First you must connect the report to a database table.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id2218390				0	uk	Move the mouse to the Properties view. You see two tab pages General and Data.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id7771538				0	uk	On the Data tab page, click Content to open the combo box.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id366527				0	uk	Select the table for that you want to create the report.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id7996459				0	uk	After selecting the table, press the Tab key to leave the Content box.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id2531815				0	uk	The Add Field window opens automatically and shows all fields of the selected table.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id5927304				0	uk	To insert fields into the report				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id4503921				0	uk	The Add Field window helps you to insert the table entries in the report. Click the Add Field icon in the toolbar to open the Add Field window.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id4051026				0	uk	Drag and drop the field names one by one from the Add Field window into the Detail area of the report. Position the fields as you like. Use the icons in the toolbars to align the fields.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id3397320				0	uk	It is not possible to overlap the fields. If you drop a table field on the Detail area, then a label and a text box are inserted.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id3059785				0	uk	You can also insert text that should be the same on every page of the report. Click the Label Field icon\<image id=\"img_id5605334\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_label.png\" width=\"0.566cm\" height=\"0.566cm\" localize=\"true\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id5605334\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>, then drag a rectangle in the Page Header or Page Footer area. Edit the Label property to show the text you want.				20220827 09:49:47
