helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145607	15			0	uk	Drives containing parts of the Serverdb are called DEVSPACEs. To improve performance, store each DEVSPACE on separate drives.				20220827 09:49:47
