helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150247	2			0	uk	In the data source explorer, you can copy a table by dragging and dropping the table onto the table container. The\<emph\> Type formatting \</emph\>dialog is the third window of the \<emph\>Copy table\</emph\> dialog.				20220827 09:49:47
