helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150661	269			0	uk	Example: select * from Item where ItemName like 'The *%' {escape '*'}				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148541	270			0	uk	The example will give you all of the entries where the item name begins with 'The *'. This means that you can also search for characters that would otherwise be interpreted as placeholders, such as *, ?, _, % or the period.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150572	271			0	uk	\<emph\>Outer Join\</emph\> Escape Sequence: {oj outer-join}				20220827 09:49:47
