helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151265	236			0	uk	=1 returns all records where the Yes/No field has the status "Yes" or "On" (selected in black),				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152450	238			0	uk	No				20220827 09:49:47
