helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	hd_id3083278	1			0	uk	\<variable id=\"language_select\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/language_select.xhp\" name=\"Selecting the Document Language\"\>Selecting the Document Language\</link\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3150040	2			0	uk	The language you select for your document determines the dictionary used for spellcheck, thesaurus and hyphenation, the decimal and thousands delimiter used and the default currency format.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3153093	3			0	uk	The language you select applies to the whole document.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3152578	4			0	uk	Within the document, you can apply a separate language to any paragraph style. This has priority over the language of the whole document.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3152886	5			0	uk	You can assign a language to selected pieces of text in a paragraph, either by direct formatting or with a character style. This assignment has priority over the paragraph style and document language.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146121	6			0	uk	Selecting a language for the whole document				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3083443	7			0	uk	Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\</emph\>. Go to \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01140000.xhp\" name=\"Language Settings - Languages\"\>\<emph\>Language Settings - Languages\</emph\>\</link\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3149664	8			0	uk	Under \<emph\>Default languages for documents\</emph\>, select the document language for all newly created documents. If you mark \<emph\>For the current document only\</emph\>, your choice will only apply to the current document. Close the dialog with \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152938	9			0	uk	Selecting a language for a Paragraph Style				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3150872	10			0	uk	Place the cursor in the paragraph whose paragraph style you want to edit.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3145367	11			0	uk	Open the context menu and select \<emph\>Edit Paragraph Style\</emph\>. This opens the \<emph\>Paragraph Style\</emph\> dialog.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3166413	12			0	uk	Select the \<emph\>Font\</emph\> tab.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3156283	13			0	uk	Select the \<emph\>Language\</emph\> and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3154942	14			0	uk	All paragraphs formatted with the current paragraph style will have the selected language.				20220827 09:49:47
