helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3145649	22			0	uk	Open the Styles and Formatting window and click on the \<emph\>Character Styles\</emph\> icon.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3146792	23			0	uk	Click on the name of the character style to which you want to apply a different language.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3150753	24			0	uk	Then open the context menu in the Styles and Formatting window and select \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>. This opens the \<emph\>Character Style\</emph\> dialog.				20220827 09:49:47
