helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3806878				0	uk	Click OK and restart the %PRODUCTNAME software.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id130619				0	uk	If the listbox doesn't list the language that you want, see "Adding More UI Languages".				20220827 09:49:47
