helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151384	9			0	uk	Viewing $[officename] documents				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669	10			0	uk	In Internet Explorer, browse to a web page that contains a link to a $[officename] Writer document, for example.				20220827 09:49:47
