helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xforms.xhp	0	help	par_idN1073B				0	uk	Open the XForms document and use the following toolbars and windows:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xforms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10741				0	uk	\<link href=\"text/shared/main0226.xhp\"\>Form Design toolbar\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xforms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10757				0	uk	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170000.xhp\"\>Form Controls toolbar\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
