helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410	7			0	uk	When you enter text, $[officename] automatically recognizes a word that may be a \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#url\" name=\"URL\"\>URL\</link\> and replaces the word with a hyperlink. $[officename] formats the hyperlink with direct font attributes (color and underline) the properties of which are obtained from certain Character Styles.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3153561	2			0	uk	If you do not want $[officename] to automatically recognize URLs as you are typing, there are several ways of turning off this feature.				20220827 09:49:47
