helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3153360	14			0	uk	If you unmark \<emph\>URL Recognition\</emph\>, words will no longer be automatically replaced with hyperlinks.				20220827 09:49:47
