helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\measurement_units.xhp	0	help	par_id3146957	2			0	uk	You can select separate measurement units for $[officename] Writer, $[officename] Writer/Web, $[officename] Calc, $[officename] Impress and $[officename] Draw documents.				20220827 09:49:47
