helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Creating Reports 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	bm_id3729667				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>databases;creating reports\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>reports;creating\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>wizards;reports\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A3				0	uk	\<variable id=\"data_reports\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/data_reports.xhp\"\>Creating Reports\</link\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C1				0	uk	A report is a Writer text document that can show your data in an organized order and formatting. In %PRODUCTNAME Base, you have a choice to create a report either manually using drag-and-drop in the Report Builder window, or semi-automatic by following a series of dialogs in the Report Wizard. 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id4094363				0	uk	The following list gives you some information to decide which method to use for your data:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id8514358				0	uk	Report Builder				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id9764091				0	uk	Report Wizard				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id1579638				0	uk	Started by "Create Report in Design View" command.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id1886959				0	uk	Started by "Use Wizard to Create Report" command.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id455030				0	uk	Full flexibility to use report headers and footers, page headers and footers, multi-column reports.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id8409985				0	uk	Uses a Writer template to generate a report document.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id5931272				0	uk	Use drag-and-drop to position the record fields or other design elements like pictures or lines.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id9869075				0	uk	Select from several given choices to arrange the data records.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id8611713				0	uk	Generates a one-time snapshot of the data. To see an updated report, execute the same report again to create a Writer document with the updated data.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id2866908				0	uk	You can choose to generate a one-time snapshot with fixed data, or a "live" report with links to the current data at the time when you open the Base file.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id4169743				0	uk	Saves the report as a Writer text document. Stores the information how to create the report inside the Base file.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id408948				0	uk	Saves the report and the information how to create the report inside the Base file.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id2891933				0	uk	Choose Open in the context menu or double-click the report name to create a new report with the current data.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id6142765				0	uk	Choose Open in the context menu or double-click the report name to either see again the static snapshot of the data from first creation time, or to create a new report with the current data. This depends on your choice on the last page of the wizard.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id1757560				0	uk	Choose Edit in the context menu of a report name to open the Report Builder window, with the report's information loaded.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id4649189				0	uk	Choose Edit in the context menu of a report name to edit the Writer template file that was used to create the report.				20220827 09:49:47
