helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3153360	8			0	uk	Replace \<emph\>{install}\</emph\> with the path to your installation of the $[officename] software (for example, \<emph\>C:\\Program Files\\Office\</emph\>, or \<emph\>~/office\</emph\>)				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3158407	9			0	uk	Where required, replace \<emph\>{parameter}\</emph\> with one or more of the following command line parameters.				20220827 09:49:47
