helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345	43			0	uk	You can customize your $[officename] to suit your needs.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3155421	49			0	uk	Use \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06140000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Customize\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Customize\</emph\>\</link\> to open the \<emph\>Customize\</emph\> dialog to change toolbars, menus and other user interface items.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3145071	46			0	uk	You are free to change the items on the menu bar. You can delete items, add new ones, copy items from one menu to another, rename them, and so on.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3149811	47			0	uk	The toolbars may be freely configured.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3150443	48			0	uk	You can change the shortcut keys.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	opt3153345	43			0	uk	You can change default settings of $[officename] to suit your needs.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	optid3155421	49			0	uk	Use \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01000000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</link\> to open the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> dialog to change a variety of settings you will use in $[officename] modules. Items presented in the \<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\> menu will change depending on the module you are using.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	opt3145071	46			0	uk	In \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/language_select.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - Language Settings\</emph\>\</link\>, you will find options for your default language and currency setting.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	opt3149811	47			0	uk	In \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040000.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - $[officename] Writer - Basic Fonts\</emph\>\</link\>, you will find default font settings. Change these to suit your preferences. Fonts can easily be changed on per document basis.				20220827 09:49:47
