helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id7211218				0	uk	Click the \<emph\>Insert Chart\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> toolbar.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id7549363				0	uk	You see a chart preview and the Chart Wizard.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id9091769				0	uk	Follow the instructions in the \<link href=\"text/schart/01/wiz_chart_type.xhp\"\>Chart Wizard\</link\> to create the chart. 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3761406				0	uk	Chart in a Writer text document				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155066	32			0	uk	In a Writer document, you can insert a chart based on the values in a Writer table. 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id428479				0	uk	Click inside the Writer table. 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id7236243				0	uk	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Object - Chart\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id6171452				0	uk	You see a chart preview and the Chart Wizard.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145419	7			0	uk	Follow the instructions in the \<link href=\"text/schart/01/wiz_chart_type.xhp\"\>Chart Wizard\</link\> to create the chart. 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id6436658				0	uk	Chart based on values of its own				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id6944792				0	uk	In Writer, if you have not selected any cells, choose \<emph\>Insert - Object - Chart\</emph\> to insert a chart with default data. In Draw or Impress, choose \<emph\>Insert - Chart\</emph\> to insert a chart based on default data.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3152960	29			0	uk	You can change the default data values by double-clicking on the chart and then choosing \<link href=\"text/schart/01/03010000.xhp\" name=\"View - Chart Data Table\"\>\<emph\>View - Chart Data Table\</emph\>\</link\>.				20220827 09:49:47
