helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_id0202200911373965				0	uk	If you don't see the Drawing toolbar or the Fontwork toolbar, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View - Toolbars\</item\> to enable the toolbar.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN1069C				0	uk	On the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> toolbar or on the \<emph\>Fontwork\</emph\> toolbar, click the \<emph\>Fontwork Gallery\</emph\> icon. \<image id=\"img_id7040009\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_fontworkgalleryfloater.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id7040009\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_id3149761	55			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select a Fontwork style and click OK to insert the Fontwork into your document. Double-click or Ctrl+double-click the Fontwork in your document to enter text edit mode and change the text.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A0				0	uk	In the \<emph\>Fontwork Gallery\</emph\> dialog, select a Fontwork style and click OK.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN10755				0	uk	The Fontwork object is inserted into your document. Fontwork objects are Custom Shapes. Using the 3D Settings toolbar, you can switch the view at any time from 2D to 3D and back.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A4				0	uk	Double-click the object to enter text edit mode.				20220827 09:49:47
