helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3147653	6			0	uk	Installing the Pocket PC filters under Windows will also install a DLL file that supports the synchronization software of your Pocket PC.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3153252	7			0	uk	The Java Runtime Environment is required to use the mobile device filters.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153665	8			0	uk	Installing the mobile device filters				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3148685	9			0	uk	Close $[officename] and the Quickstarter.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3156023	10			0	uk	If you are using the Windows operating system with ActiveSync installed, disconnect any Pocket PC device from ActiveSync.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3153061	11			0	uk	Start the $[officename] Setup program:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_idN107E7				0	uk	Open the Windows \<emph\>Start\</emph\> button, choose \<emph\>Control Panel\</emph\>, double-click \<emph\>Add or Remove Programs\</emph\>, select the %PRODUCTNAME %PRODUCTVERSION entry, click \<emph\>Change\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3146794	12			0	uk	In Setup, choose the \<emph\>Modify\</emph\> option and click \<emph\>Next\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3151054	13			0	uk	Open the \<emph\>Optional Components\</emph\> entry, then open the \<emph\>Mobile Device Filters\</emph\> entry. Select the filters you want to install.				20220827 09:49:47
