helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3145419	18			0	uk	Enter a name and click \<emph\>Save\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153768	19			0	uk	Opening mobile device documents in $[officename]				20220827 09:49:47
