helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3147428	21			0	uk	Open the \<emph\>File type\</emph\> box and select the appropriate filter.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3148618	22			0	uk	Select the file and click \<emph\>Open\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159196	23			0	uk	Synchronizing file types				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3145272	24			0	uk	To convert Pocket PC formats to and from $[officename] formats, you must first change some options within ActiveSync. To do this, open the ActiveSync window and open its Options dialog. Perform the following steps:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3149064	25			0	uk	Select the \<emph\>Rules\</emph\> tab.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3147216	26			0	uk	Click the \<emph\>Conversion Settings\</emph\> button.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3154145	27			0	uk	Click the \<emph\>Device to Desktop\</emph\> tab.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3159155	28			0	uk	Select \<emph\>Pocket Word Document - Pocket PC\</emph\> and click \<emph\>Edit\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3154638	29			0	uk	In the drop down list of available conversions, select \<emph\>$[officename] Writer \</emph\>and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3149958	30			0	uk	Repeat steps 4 and 5 for \<emph\>Pocket Excel Workbook\</emph\> selecting \<emph\>$[officename] Calc\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3148389	31			0	uk	After these steps you can copy documents between $[officename] and your Pocket PC, either by the ActiveSync software or by the Windows Explorer. The filters will be applied to the document files automatically.				20220827 09:49:47
