helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008	68			0	uk	With the help of SQL commands you can control the database directly, and can also create and edit tables and queries.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id3153562	72			0	uk	Not all database types support all SQL instructions. If necessary, find out which SQL commands are supported by your database system.				20220827 09:49:47
