helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id3145786	92			0	uk	Select an existing query from the list and click the \<emph\>Edit\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3156212\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_dbqueryedit.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156212\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>.				20220827 09:49:47
