helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751	17			0	uk	The \<emph\>Hyperlink\</emph\> Bar can be used to search for the selected text in the Internet.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_idN10620				0	uk	Choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars - Hyperlink Bar\</emph\> to open the Hyperlink Bar.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267	18			0	uk	Enter the text you want to find in the \<emph\>URL Name\</emph\> field.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774	23			0	uk	If you select text in your document, the text is automatically entered.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_id3153662	19			0	uk	Click the \<emph\>Find\</emph\> icon to open a submenu.				20220827 09:49:47
