helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149180	35			0	uk	\<variable id=\"pageformat_max\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/pageformat_max.xhp\" name=\"Selecting the Maximum Printable Area on a Page\"\>Selecting the Maximum Printable Area on a Page\</link\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3156426	36			0	uk	Not all printers can print a paper up to its edges. Most of them leave an unprinted margin.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3149182	37			0	uk	$[officename] offers a semi-automatic feature that enables you to print as close to the paper's edge as is possible.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233	38			0	uk	Make sure that your printer has been setup under \<emph\>File - Printer Settings\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3156114	39			0	uk	Make sure that the \<emph\>Web Layout\</emph\> in the \<emph\>View\</emph\> menu is not selected.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3147653	40			0	uk	Select the \<emph\>Format - Page\</emph\> command, and go to the \<emph\>Page\</emph\> tab.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3147335	41			0	uk	Under \<emph\>Margins\</emph\> you can define the maximum or minimum possible value for the page margins (left, right, top, and bottom). Click into the respective control, then press the Page Up or Page Down key. The preview displays a dashed line around the printable range.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3145120	42			0	uk	Натисніть \<emph\>Гаразд\</emph\>, щоб закрити діалог.				20220827 09:49:47
