helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN1091F				0	uk	In addition, developers can use high-level languages, for example Java programming language, to control %PRODUCTNAME externally. See the API project at Apache OpenOffice.				20220827 09:49:47
