helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\version_number.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346	5			0	uk	Choose \<emph\>Help - About $[officename]\</emph\>. This opens a dialog containing information about the program, like the version and build number.				20220827 09:49:47
