helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\change_title.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345	5			0	uk	Choose \<emph\>File - Properties\</emph\>. This opens the \<emph\>Properties of\</emph\> dialog.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\change_title.xhp	0	help	par_id3156410	6			0	uk	Select the \<emph\>Description\</emph\> tab.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\change_title.xhp	0	help	par_id3147242	7			0	uk	Type the new title in the \<emph\>Title\</emph\> box and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
