helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id1376079				0	uk	On the horizontal ruler you can see the tab stops for the current paragraph. If you want to change the tab stops, you should first consider the scope to which you want to change tab stops as follows:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id9434492				0	uk	Change the default tab stops for all documents: Use the menu \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - General\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id274971				0	uk	Change the tab stops for all paragraphs using the current Paragraph Style: Right-click the paragraph to open the context menu, choose \<emph\>Edit Paragraph Style\</emph\>, click \<emph\>Tabs\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id5199133				0	uk	Change the tab stops for one or more paragraphs: Select the paragraphs, then click inside the ruler.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id6178167				0	uk	In the following, you find instructions for all above mentioned tasks.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008	27			0	uk	You can set a tab stop by clicking on the ruler or by selecting \<emph\>Format - Paragraph - Tabs.\</emph\> Both methods affect the current paragraph or all selected paragraphs.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3155136	5			0	uk	Click the ruler once to set a left-justified tab. Right-click a tab icon on the ruler to see the context menu in which you can change the tab type.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3153561	29			0	uk	To set several decimal tabs one after the other, keep clicking the icon to the left of the ruler until the desired tab type is shown, then click on the ruler.				20220827 09:49:47
