helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\active_help_on_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3157958	2			0	uk	\<emph\>Extended tips\</emph\> provide a brief description of the function of a particular icon, text box or menu command when you rest your cursor on that item.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\active_help_on_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155339	3			0	uk	To turn Extended Tips on and off:				20220827 09:49:47
