helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\active_help_on_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3149398	5			0	uk	A check mark indicates that the extended tips are activated.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\active_help_on_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149811	6			0	uk	To turn Extended Tips on temporarily:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\active_help_on_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3153541	7			0	uk	Press the shortcut keys Shift+F1 to activate extended tips once.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\active_help_on_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3153825	8			0	uk	A question mark appears beside the mouse pointer. You can move this \<emph\>Help Mouse Pointer\</emph\> over all controls, icons and menu commands to obtain a description of the command. The \<emph\>Help Mouse Pointer\</emph\> is disabled the next time you click the mouse.				20220827 09:49:47
