helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_search2.xhp	0	help	par_id3149666	7			0	uk	Enter the filter conditions into one or several fields. Note that if you enter filter conditions into several fields, all of the entered conditions must match (Boolean AND).				20220827 09:49:47
