helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	par_id1175572				0	uk	In the Base window, choose \<emph\>Edit - Paste\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	par_id4815820				0	uk	You see the Copy Table dialog. Most databases need a primary key, so you may want to check the \<emph\>Create primary key\</emph\> box.				20220827 09:49:47
