helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\workfolder.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774	3			0	uk	When you start a dialog to open or save a document, $[officename] initially displays your working directory. To change this directory:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\workfolder.xhp	0	help	par_id3153681	4			0	uk	Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - $[officename] - Paths\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
