helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\workfolder.xhp	0	help	par_id3153880	6			0	uk	In the \<emph\>Select Path\</emph\> dialog, choose the working directory you want and click \<emph\>Select\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
