helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422	14			0	uk	If you drag objects out of the \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/navigator.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>\<emph\>Navigator\</emph\>\</link\>, you can specify in the submenu of the Navigator's \<emph\>Drag Mode\</emph\> icon whether to copy the object, insert it as a link or insert it as a hyperlink.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop.xhp	0	help	par_id3153144	4			0	uk	You can cancel a drag-and-drop operation in $[officename] at any time by pressing the Esc key before releasing the mouse button.				20220827 09:49:47
