helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149095	2			0	uk	Specifies the settings for importing and exporting Microsoft Office OLE objects.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233	7			0	uk	These settings are valid when no Microsoft OLE server exists (for example, in UNIX) or when there is no $[officename] OLE server ready for editing the OLE objects.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id0107200910364795				0	uk	If an OLE server is active for the embedded object, then the OLE server will be used to handle the object.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id0107200910364725				0	uk	If no OLE server is active for MathType objects, then embedded MathType objects can be converted to %PRODUCTNAME Math objects. For this conversion, the embedded MathType objects must not exceed the MathType 3.1 specifications.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146798	3			0	uk	List Box				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150670	4			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OFAPAGE_MSFLTR2_CLB\"\>The\<emph\> List Box \</emph\>field displays the entries for the pair of OLE objects that can be converted when loading into $[officename] (L) and/or when saving into a Microsoft format (S). \</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154286	5			0	uk	Mark the box in the [L] column in front of the entry if a Microsoft OLE object is to be converted into the specified $[officename] OLE object when a Microsoft document is loaded into $[officename].				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153880	6			0	uk	Mark the box in the [S] column in front of the entry if a $[officename] OLE object is to be converted into the specified Microsoft OLE object when a document is saved in a Microsoft file format.				20220827 09:49:47
