helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154365	24			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_REDLINE_OPT_LB_DEL_ATTR\"\>Specifies how changes in the document are displayed when text is deleted. If you record text deletions, the text is displayed with the selected attribute (for example, strikethrough) and is not deleted.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148674	25			0	uk	Changed attributes / Attributes				20220827 09:49:47
