helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154572	38			0	uk	The \<emph\>Load color list\</emph\> and \<emph\>Save color list \</emph\>icons are visible only if you select the \<emph\>Colors\</emph\> tab with the \<emph\>Format - Area\</emph\> command.				20220827 09:49:47
