helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10644				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the "Security options and warning" dialog.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_id5616626				0	uk	The Security options and warnings dialog contains the following controls:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10647				0	uk	When saving or sending				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN1064B				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"703988739\"\>Select to see a warning dialog when you try to save or send a document that contains recorded changes, versions, or comments.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN1064E				0	uk	When printing				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10652				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"703988740\"\>Select to see a warning dialog when you try to print a document that contains recorded changes or comments.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10655				0	uk	When signing				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10659				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"703988741\"\>Select to see a warning dialog when you try to sign a document that contains recorded changes, versions, fields, references to other sources (for example linked sections or linked pictures), or comments.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN1065C				0	uk	When creating PDF files				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10660				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"703988742\"\>Select to see a warning dialog when you try to export a document to PDF format that displays recorded changes in Writer, or that displays comments.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10663				0	uk	Remove personal information on saving				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10667				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"703988743\"\>Select to always remove user data from the file properties. If this option is not selected, you can still remove the personal information for the current document with the \<emph\>Reset\</emph\> button on \<emph\>File - Properties - General\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN1067C				0	uk	Recommend password protection on saving				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10680				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"703988744\"\>Select to always enable the \<emph\>Save with password\</emph\> option in the file save dialogs. Deselect the option to save files by default without password.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id1972106				0	uk	Ctrl-click required to follow hyperlinks				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_id79042				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>If enabled, you must hold down the Ctrl key while clicking a hyperlink to follow that link. If not enabled, a click opens the hyperlink.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id4076357				0	uk	Passwords for web connections				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_id8231757				0	uk	You can enter a master password to enable easy access to sites that require a user name and password.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3168736				0	uk	Persistently save passwords protected by a master password				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_id1909848				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>If enabled, %PRODUCTNAME will securely store all passwords that you use to access files from web servers. You can retrieve the passwords from the list after you enter the master password.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
