helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154142	37			0	uk	You can also define this setting by using the \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/13140000.xhp\" name=\"Snap to Guides\"\>\<emph\>Snap to Guides\</emph\>\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/13140000.xhp\" name=\"Snap to Guides\"\>\<emph\>Snap to Guides\</emph\>\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Snap to Guides\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> icon, which is available in the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> bar in a presentation or drawing document.				20220827 09:49:47
