helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id5319071				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Type the name of the proxy server for HTTPS. Type the port in the right-hand field.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150543	33			0	uk	FTP proxy				20220827 09:49:47
