helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3125863	24			0	uk	No proxy for				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151178	25			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:EDIT:RID_SVXPAGE_INET_PROXY:ED_NOPROXYFOR\"\>Specifies the names of the servers that do not require any proxy servers, separated by semicolons.\</ahelp\> These are servers addressed in your local network, and servers used for video and audio streaming, for example.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145171	26			0	uk	You can also use placeholders for the names of hosts and domains. For example, type *.sun.com to address all the hosts in the sun.com domain without proxy.				20220827 09:49:47
