helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150983	43			0	uk	Check uppercase words				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3152582	44			0	uk	Specifies that capitalization is checked during spellcheck.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150826	45			0	uk	Check words with numbers.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150208	46			0	uk	Specifies that words that contain numbers as well as letters are to be checked.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147509	47			0	uk	Check capitalization				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154200	48			0	uk	Checks for the correct use of capitals at the start of words during spellcheck.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166424	49			0	uk	Check special regions				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150345	50			0	uk	Specifies that special regions, such as drawing text, are checked during spellcheck.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166429	21			0	uk	Check spelling as you type				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155531	6			0	uk	\<variable id=\"automatisch\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SpellOnline\"\>Automatically checks spelling as you type, and underlines errors.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156291	32			0	uk	Typing errors are highlighted in the document with a red underline. If you place the cursor over a word marked in this way, you can open the context menu to obtain a list of corrections. Select a correction to replace the word. If you make the same mistake again while editing the document, it will be marked as an error again.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153815	23			0	uk	To place the word pair in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040200.xhp\" name=\"AutoCorrect replacement table\"\>AutoCorrect replacement table\</link\>, open the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040500.xhp\" name=\"AutoCorrect context menu\"\>AutoCorrect context menu\</link\> and choose \<emph\>AutoCorrect\</emph\>. Make your selection from the submenu. The word is replaced and at the same time the word pair is placed in the replacement table.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150111	53			0	uk	Minimal number of characters for hyphenation 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150316	54			0	uk	Specifies the minimum number of characters required for automatic hyphenation to be applied. \<ahelp hid=\"HID_LNGDLG_NUM_PREBREAK\" visibility=\"hidden\"\> Type the minimum number of characters that must come before or after the hyphen.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148823	11			0	uk	Characters before line break				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156029	12			0	uk	Sets the minimum number of characters of the word to be hyphenated that must remain at the end of the line.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154956	13			0	uk	Characters after line break				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149439	14			0	uk	Specifies the minimum number of characters of a hyphenated word required at the next line.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156337	15			0	uk	Hyphenate without inquiry				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3151130	16			0	uk	Specifies that you will never be asked for a manual hyphenation. If the field is not marked, when a word is not recognized you will be presented with a dialog for entering hyphens.				20220827 09:49:47
