helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149516	9			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Applies a thin border to the formula area in the printout.\</ahelp\> \<emph\>Title\</emph\> and \<emph\>Formula text\</emph\> are only set down by a frame if the corresponding check box is active.				20220827 09:49:47
