helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01014000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153562	2			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Sets the options for a remote configuration access to your personal $[officename] settings stored on an LDAP server.\</ahelp\> To see this tab page and to use this feature, remote configuration must be active: You need an account on an LDAP server that is running and configured to store $[officename] user settings.				20220827 09:49:47
