helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107F3				0	uk	\<emph\>On click\</emph\> - the animation stops at this effect until the next mouse click.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107FA				0	uk	\<emph\>With previous\</emph\> - the animation runs immediately.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10801				0	uk	\<emph\>After previous\</emph\> - the animation runs as soon as the previous animation ends.				20220827 09:49:47
