helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050700.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974	2			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:convert_to_contour\"\>Converts the selected object to a polygon, or a group of polygons.\</ahelp\> If the conversion creates a group of polygons (for example, when you convert a text object), then press F3 to enter the group before you can select an individual polygon.				20220827 09:49:47
