helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3083445	85			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:CHECKBOX:DLG_START_PRESENTATION:CBX_ANIMATION_ALLOWED\"\>Displays all frames of animated GIF files during the slide show.\</ahelp\> If this option is not selected, only the first frame of an animated GIF file is displayed.				20220827 09:49:47
