helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156449	4			0	uk	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"SD_PUSHBUTTON_DLG_DEFINE_CUSTOMSHOW_BTN_ADD\"\>Adds an existing slide to the bottom of the \<emph\>Selected slides\</emph\> list. You need to select a slide in the \<emph\>Existing slides\</emph\> list before you can use this button.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
