helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150332	36			0	uk	Drag the symmetry line to a new location to change the shape of the converted object. To change the orientation of the symmetry line, drag one of its end points. Click the object to convert it to 3D. 				20220827 09:49:47
