helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155445				0	uk	\<image id=\"img_id3149018\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_connector.png\" width=\"0.423cm\" height=\"0.423cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149018\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154702	3			0	uk	Connector				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488	2			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ConnectorToolbox\"\>Open the \<emph\>Connectors\</emph\> toolbar, where you can add connectors to objects in the current slide. A connector is a line that joins objects, and remains attached when the objects are moved. If you copy an object with a connector, the connector is also copied.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154658	122			0	uk	There are four types of connector lines:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145584	123			0	uk	Standard (90-degree angle bends)				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154485	124			0	uk	Line (two bends)				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153817	125			0	uk	Straight				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149943	126			0	uk	Curved				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148604	4			0	uk	When you click a connector and move your mouse pointer over a filled object, or the edge of an unfilled object, gluepoints appear. A gluepoint is a fixed point where you can attach a connector line. You can add custom \<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10030200.xhp\" name=\"glue point\"\>gluepoints\</link\> to an object.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154762	5			0	uk	To draw a connector line, click a gluepoint on an object, drag to a gluepoint on another object, and then release. You can also drag to an empty part of you document and click. The unattached end of the connector is locked in place, until you drag the end to a different location. To detach a connector, drag either end of the connector line to a different location.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147297	9			0	uk	Connector				20220827 09:49:47
