helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\arrange_slides.xhp	0	help	par_id3151242	44			0	uk	Do one of the following:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\arrange_slides.xhp	0	help	par_id3143233	40			0	uk	Choose \<emph\>View - Slide Sorter\</emph\>, select one or more slides, and then drag the slides to another location. To select multiple slides, hold down shift and click on the slides. To create a copy of a selected slide, hold down Ctrl while you drag. The mouse pointer changes to a plus sign. You can also drag a copy of a slide into another open $[officename] Impress document.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\arrange_slides.xhp	0	help	par_id3153072	45			0	uk	Choose \<emph\>View - Outline\</emph\>, select a slide, and then drag the slide to another location.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\arrange_slides.xhp	0	help	par_id3150391	46			0	uk	Choose \<emph\>View - Normal\</emph\> or \<emph\>Notes\</emph\>, select the slide preview on the \<emph\>Slides Pane\</emph\>, and then drag the slide preview to another location.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\arrange_slides.xhp	0	help	par_id3153079	23			0	uk	To temporarily remove a slide from your presentation, go to \<emph\>Slide Sorter\</emph\>, right-click the slide, and then choose \<emph\>Show/Hide Slide\</emph\>. The number of the hidden slide is crossed out. To show the slide, right-click the slide, and then choose \<emph\>Show/Hide Slide\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
