helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146119	55			0	uk	\<variable id=\"individual\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/individual.xhp\" name=\"Creating a Custom Slide Show\"\>Creating a Custom Slide Show\</link\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3150344	71			0	uk	You can create custom slide shows to meet the needs of your audience using slides within the current presentation.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150715	72			0	uk	To create a custom slide show:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3153712	61			0	uk	Choose \<emph\>Slide Show - Custom Slide Shows\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3153966	62			0	uk	Click \<emph\>New\</emph\> and enter a name for your slide show in the \<emph\>Name \</emph\>box.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3150249	73			0	uk	Under \<emph\>Existing Slides\</emph\>, select the slides you want to add to your slide show, and click the \<emph\>>\</emph\> button. Hold down Shift to select a range of slides, or Ctrl to select multiple slides.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3153916	64			0	uk	You can change the order of the slides in your custom slide show, by dragging and dropping the slides under \<emph\>Selected Slides\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151387	74			0	uk	To start a custom slide show:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3147403	75			0	uk	Choose \<emph\>Slide Show - Custom Slide Show\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3150538	76			0	uk	Select the show you want to start from the list.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3149943	77			0	uk	Натисніть \<emph\>Гаразд\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3145593	56			0	uk	If you want the selected custom slide show to start when you click the \<emph\>Slide Show\</emph\> icon on the\<emph\> Presentation\</emph\> toolbar, or when you press F5, select \<emph\>Use Custom Slide Show\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
