helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\change_scale.xhp	0	help	par_id3148487	11			0	uk	You can use the keypad to quickly enlarge or reduce the view on your slide.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\change_scale.xhp	0	help	par_id3149501	12			0	uk	To zoom in, press the Plus Sign.				20220827 09:49:47
