helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154702				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>accessibility; $[officename] Impress\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154702	1			0	uk	\<variable id=\"keyboard\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/keyboard.xhp\" name=\"Using Shortcut Keys in $[officename] Impress\"\>Using Shortcut Keys in $[officename] Impress\</link\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148610	11			0	uk	You can use the keyboard to access $[officename] Impress commands as well as to navigate through the workspace. $[officename] Impress uses the same shortcut keys as $[officename] Draw to create \<link href=\"text/sdraw/guide/keyboard.xhp\" name=\"drawing objects\"\>drawing objects\</link\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149602	18			0	uk	Selecting placeholders				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3150212	10			0	uk	$[officename] Impress \<emph\>AutoLayouts\</emph\> use placeholders for slide titles, text, and objects. To select a placeholder, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+Enter\</item\>. To move to the next placeholder, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+Enter\</item\> again.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3166467	9			0	uk	If you press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+Enter\</item\> after you reach the last placeholder in a slide, a new slide is inserted after the current slide. The new slide uses the same layout as the current slide.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157871	8			0	uk	During a Slide Show				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3150650	7			0	uk	To start a slide show, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+F2\</item\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149354	5			0	uk	Advance to the next slide or to the next animation effect				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148728	4			0	uk	\<item type=\"keycode\"\>Spacebar\</item\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153035	19			0	uk	Advance to the next slide without playing object animation effects				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155263	20			0	uk	\<item type=\"keycode\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+PageDown\</item\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154558	3			0	uk	Return to previous slide				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145590	2			0	uk	\<item type=\"keycode\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+PageUp\</item\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153003	12			0	uk	Go to a specific slide				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154501	13			0	uk	Type the page number of the slide, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Enter\</item\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150337	14			0	uk	Slide Sorter				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153732	21			0	uk	When you first switch to Slide Sorter, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Enter\</item\> to change the keyboard focus to the workspace. Otherwise, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>F6\</item\> to navigate to the workspace, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Enter\</item\>. 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149882	22			0	uk	Selecting and deselecting slides				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155930	15			0	uk	Use the arrow keys to navigate to the slide that you want to select, and then press the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Spacebar\</item\>. To add to the selection, use the arrow keys to navigate to the slide(s) that you want to add, and press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Spacebar\</item\> again. To deselect a slide, navigate to the slide, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Spacebar\</item\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145248	23			0	uk	Copying a slide:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3156060	16			0	uk	Use the arrow keys to navigate to the slide that you want to copy, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+C\</item\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148769	24			0	uk	Move to the slide where you want to paste the copied slide, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+V\</item\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148388	25			0	uk	Select \<emph\>Before \</emph\>or \<emph\>After\</emph\> the current slide, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155367	26			0	uk	Moving a slide:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155987	27			0	uk	Use the arrow keys to navigate to the slide that you want to move, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+X\</item\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3147171	28			0	uk	Navigate to the slide where you want to move the slide, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+V\</item\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3083282	29			0	uk	Select \<emph\>Before \</emph\>or \<emph\>After\</emph\> the current slide, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Loading Line and Arrow Styles				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145253				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>line styles;loading\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>lines;about line ends\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>arrows;loading arrow styles\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>styles;arrow and line styles\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>loading;arrow and line styles\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145253	48			0	uk	\<variable id=\"line_arrow_styles\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/line_arrow_styles.xhp\" name=\"Loading Line and Arrow Styles\"\>Loading Line and Arrow Styles\</link\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3154017	49			0	uk	You can use styles to organize similar line and arrow types. $[officename] provides a few standard style files that you can load and use in your document. If you want, you can add or delete elements from a style file, or even create a custom style file.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154485	50			0	uk	To load a line styles file:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3156382	58			0	uk	Choose \<emph\>Format - Line\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Line Styles\</emph\> tab.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3154705	51			0	uk	Click the \<emph\>Load Line Styles\</emph\> button.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3145588	52			0	uk	Locate the file containing the line styles that you want to load, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. The file has the format [filename].sod.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3151240	53			0	uk	To save a line styles file, click the \<emph\>Save Line Styles\</emph\> button, enter a filename, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154765	54			0	uk	To load an arrow styles file:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3153070	59			0	uk	Choose \<emph\>Format - Line\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Arrow Styles\</emph\> tab.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3149054	55			0	uk	Click the \<emph\>Load Arrow Styles\</emph\> button.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150391	56			0	uk	Locate the file containing the arrow styles that you want to load, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. The file has the format [filename].soe.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3166465	57			0	uk	To save an arrow styles file, click the \<emph\>Save Arrow Styles\</emph\> button, enter a filename, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3145822				0	uk	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05200000.xhp\" name=\"Format - Line\"\>Format - Line\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Including Spreadsheets in Slides				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154022				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>spreadsheets;in presentations\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>presentations;inserting spreadsheets\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>including spreadsheets\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154022	1			0	uk	\<variable id=\"table_insert\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/table_insert.xhp\" name=\"Including Spreadsheets in Slides\"\>Including Spreadsheets in Slides\</link\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id4231086				0	uk	You can apply different methods to insert spreadsheet cells into your Impress slides or Draw pages:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id9209875				0	uk	Insert a native table - you enter the data into the cells and apply fancy formatting using the Table Design section on the Tasks pane.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3044526				0	uk	Insert a new table as an OLE object or insert an existing file as an OLE object - you can specify the link to a file to be a live link to the latest data saved in a spreadsheet file.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id137333				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter the number of columns for the new table.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id8626667				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter the number of rows for the new table.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551581				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Define the vertical alignment of selected or all cell contents. Split or merge cells.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551553				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>All selected cells are merged into one cell.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551535				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The selected cell is split into several cells. You see the Split Cells dialog box.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551651				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The cell contents are align at the top of the cells.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551697				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The cell contents are aligned vertically centered in the cells.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551632				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The cell contents are aligned at the bottom of the cells.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_idN10626				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Selects the current table.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551734				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Choose commands for the selected or all rows.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200804080035				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Distributes the height of the selected or all rows to the same size. The height of the table is not changed.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200804080063				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>If currently no cell is selected, all rows will be selected. If currently cells are selected, all rows containing the selected cells will be selected.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id091620080408008				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>If currently no cell is selected, a new row will be inserted at the bottom of the table. If currently cells are selected, as many new rows as the selection has will be inserted below the selection.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200804080050				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>All rows of the current selection will be deleted.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200804163012				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Choose commands for the selected or all columns.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200804163092				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Distributes the width of the selected or all columns to the same size. The width of the table is not changed.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200804163046				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>If currently no cell is selected, all columns will be selected. If currently cells are selected, all columns containing the selected cells will be selected.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200804163128				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>If currently no cell is selected, a new column will be inserted at the right border of the table. If currently cells are selected, as many new columns as the selection has will be inserted right of the selection.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200804163127				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>All columns of the current selection will be deleted.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200804163151				0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Align the table within the page or slide.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
