helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id7184972				0	uk	Go to the Impress slide or Draw page where you want to insert the table.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id248115				0	uk	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Table\</item\> or use the Table icon on the Standard toolbar to insert a table.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id2748496				0	uk	Double-click the table and enter or paste the data into the cells. 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id8270210				0	uk	Select some cell contents and right-click to open the context menu. Choose commands to change the cell's contents, like font size and line spacing.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id6820276				0	uk	Right-click the table border to open the table's context menu. Use the table's context menu to enter a name and description for the table, or to distribute the rows or columns equally, among other commands.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551725				0	uk	Select some cells and right-click to open a context menu, where you can insert or delete rows and columns, among other commands. 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id091620080355171				0	uk	To select a rectangular area of cells, point to a cell in one corner of the rectangle, hold down the mouse button, and drag the mouse to the opposite corner of the rectangle, then release the mouse button. 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551880				0	uk	To select one cell, point to that cell, hold down the mouse button, and drag the mouse to the next cell and back, then release the mouse button.				20220827 09:49:47
