helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3150537	20			0	uk	Locate the file you want to insert, and then click\<emph\> OK\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id1616565				0	uk	Enable the \<emph\>Link to file\</emph\> checkbox to insert the file as a live link.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155256	21			0	uk	The entire spreadsheet is inserted into your slide. If you want to change the sheet that is displayed, double-click the spreadsheet, and then select a different sheet.				20220827 09:49:47
