helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3149941	60			0	uk	Select a data point, and then click the \<emph\>Split Curve \</emph\>icon on the \<emph\>Edit Points\</emph\> Bar.				20220827 09:49:47
