helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\palette_files.xhp	0	help	par_id3156385	73			0	uk	You can use lists to organize colors, gradients, or hatching patterns. $[officename] provides several lists that you can load and use in your document. If you want, you can add or delete elements from a list, or even create custom lists. 				20220827 09:49:47
