helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\text2curve.xhp	0	help	par_id3155960	21			0	uk	You can convert text characters into curves that you can edit and resize as you would any drawing object. Once you convert text into a drawing object, you can no longer edit the content of the text.				20220827 09:49:47
