helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\text2curve.xhp	0	help	par_id3150395	23			0	uk	In $[officename] Impress, right-click the border of the text object, and then choose \<emph\>Convert - To Curve\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\text2curve.xhp	0	help	par_id3150746	6			0	uk	If your text contains more than one character, the converted text becomes a grouped object. Double-click the group to edit individual objects. Press Esc when finished.				20220827 09:49:47
