helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\minimizer\main.xhp	0	help	par_id77665502				0	uk	The Presentation Minimizer is used to reduce the file size of the current presentation. Images will be compressed and data, that is no longer needed, will be removed.				20220827 09:49:47
