helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150249	2			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Decreases the display scale of formulas by 25%.\</ahelp\> The current zoom factor is displayed on the status bar. A selection of available zoom options is accessible through the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000001.xhp#kontextmenue\" name=\"context menu\"\>context menu\</link\>. The context menu in the work area also contains zoom commands.				20220827 09:49:47
