helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3150537	13			0	uk	You can compose formulas using the Elements window. Open it with the menu \<emph\>View - Elements\</emph\> if it is not already open.				20220827 09:49:47
