helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155178	10			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:COMBOBOX:DLG_INSERT_BOOKMARK:CB_BOOKMARK\"\>Type the name of the bookmark that you want to create. The lower list contains all of the bookmarks in the current document. To delete a bookmark, select it in the list, and then click \<emph\>Delete\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149483	13			0	uk	You cannot use the following characters in a bookmark name: / \\ @ : * ? " ; , . #				20220827 09:49:47
