helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149805	7			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_BREAK:RB_LINE\"\>Ends the current line, and moves the text found to the right of the cursor to the next line, without creating a new paragraph.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
