helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147512	1			0	uk	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02120000.xhp\" name=\"Автотекст\"\>Автотекст\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154571	2			0	uk	\<variable id=\"autotexttext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EditGlossary\"\>Creates, edits, or inserts AutoText. You can store formatted text, text with graphics, tables, and fields as AutoText. To quickly insert AutoText, type the shortcut for the AutoText in your document, and then press F3.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143277	52			0	uk	You can also click the arrow next to the \<emph\>AutoText\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> bar, and then choose the AutoText that you want to insert.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148982	4			0	uk	Автотекст				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153640	5			0	uk	The \<emph\>AutoText \</emph\>dialog lists the AutoText categories and entries.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152766	6			0	uk	Відображати нагадування назви як підказку при введенні				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145758	51			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:DLG_GLOSSARY:CB_INSERT_TIP\"\>Displays a suggestion for completing a word as a Help Tip after you type the first three letters of a word that matches an AutoText entry. To accept the suggestion, press Enter. If more than one AutoText entry matches the letters that you type, press Ctrl+Tab to advance through the entries.\</ahelp\> For example, to insert dummy text, type "Dum", and then press Enter.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177	53			0	uk	To display the list in reverse order, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+Tab.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151378	9			0	uk	Назва				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155862	10			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:DLG_GLOSSARY:ED_NAME\"\>Lists the name of the currently selected AutoText entry. If you have selected text in the document, type the name of the new AutoText entry, click the \<emph\>AutoText \</emph\>button, and then choose \<emph\>New\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150113	12			0	uk	Ярлик				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147413	13			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:DLG_GLOSSARY:ED_SHORTNAME\"\>Displays the shortcut for the selected AutoText entry. If you are creating a new AutoText entry, type the shortcut that you want to use for the entry.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149558	65			0	uk	Список				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145257	8			0	uk	Lists the AutoText categories. To view the AutoText entries in a category, double-click the category, or click the plus sign (+) in front of the category. To insert an AutoText entry into the current document, select the entry in the list, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153300	66			0	uk	You can drag and drop AutoText entries from one category to another.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156124	14			0	uk	Вставити				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156094	15			0	uk	Inserts the selected AutoText into the current document.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148788	75			0	uk	If you insert an unformatted AutoText entry into a paragraph, the entry is formatted with the current paragraph style.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150039	17			0	uk	Автотекст				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153127	18			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:MENUBUTTON:DLG_GLOSSARY:PB_EDIT\"\>Click to display additional AutoText commands, for example, to create a new AutoText entry from a text selection in the current document.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154618	19			0	uk	Створити				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154635	20			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_MD_GLOS_DEFINE\"\>Creates a new AutoText entry from the selection that you made in the current document. The entry is added to the currently selected AutoText category. You must first enter a name before you see this command.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149643	62			0	uk	Створити (тільки текст)				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150668	63			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_MD_GLOS_DEFINE_TEXT\"\>Creates a new AutoText entry only from the text in the selection that you made in the current document. Graphics, tables and other objects are not included. You must first enter a name before you see this command.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154025	73			0	uk	Копіювати				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154043	74			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_MD_COPY_TO_CLIPBOARD\"\>Copies the selected AutoText to the clipboard.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149965	21			0	uk	Замінити				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149607	22			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_MD_GLOS_REPLACE\"\>Replaces the contents of the selected AutoText entry with the selection that was made in the current document.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150768	23			0	uk	Перейменувати				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150786	24			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Opens the Rename AutoText dialog, where you can change the name of the selected AutoText entry.\</ahelp\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02120100.xhp\" name=\"Rename Text Block\"\>Rename AutoText\</link\> dialog, where you can change the name of the selected AutoText entry.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155341	35			0	uk	Редагування				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155358	36			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_MD_GLOS_EDIT\"\>Opens the selected AutoText entry for editing in a separate document. Make the changes that you want, choose \<emph\>File - Save AutoText\</emph\>, and then choose \<emph\>File - Close\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155555	43			0	uk	Макрос				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145106	44			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Opens the Assign Macro dialog, where you attach a macro to the selected AutoText entry.\</ahelp\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05060700.xhp\" name=\"Assign Macro\"\>Assign Macro\</link\> dialog, where you attach a macro to the selected AutoText entry.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149583	76			0	uk	You can also use the macros that are linked to some of the provided AutoText entries in AutoText entries that you create. The AutoText entries must be created with the "text only" option. For example, insert the string <field:company> in an AutoText entry, and $[officename] replaces the string with the contents of the corresponding database field.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149597	77			0	uk	Імпорт				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148937	78			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_MD_GLOS_IMPORT\"\>Opens a dialog where you can select the MS 97/2000/XP Word document or template, containing the AutoText entries that you want to import.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156038	37			0	uk	Категорії				20220827 09:49:47
