helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150802	40			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:DLG_BIB_BASE:ED_NAME\"\>Displays the name of the selected AutoText category. To change the name of the category, type a new name, and then click \<emph\>Rename\</emph\>. To create a new category, type a name, and then click \<emph\>New\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155318	79			0	uk	Шлях				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155335	80			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_DLG_BIB_BASE_LB_PATH\"\>Displays the current path to the directory where the selected AutoText category files are stored. If you are creating an AutoText category, select where you want to store the category files.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154410	41			0	uk	Створити				20220827 09:49:47
