helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156064	61			0	uk	To add a new path to an AutoText directory, click the \<emph\>Path\</emph\> button in the \<emph\>AutoText \</emph\>dialog.				20220827 09:49:47
