helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149807	8			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Sets a maximum height for the footnote area. Enable this option, then enter the height.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
