helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3154827	18			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:TP_FOOTNOTE_PAGE:ED_LINEWIDTH\"\>Enter the length of the separator line as a percentage of the page width area.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
