helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3146865	22			0	uk	You can also insert database fields in the \<emph\>Then \</emph\>and \<emph\>Else \</emph\>boxes using the format "databasename.tablename.fieldname".				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147583	24			0	uk	If the table or the field name does not exist in a database, nothing is inserted.				20220827 09:49:47
