helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154106				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>tags; in $[officename] Writer\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>$[officename] Writer; special HTML tags\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>HTML;special tags for fields\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>fields;HTML import and export\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>time fields;HTML\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>date fields;HTML\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>DocInformation fields\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154106	1			0	uk	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090007.xhp\" name=\"Спеціальні теги\"\>Спеціальні теги\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3153669	3			0	uk	When you save a document that contains fields as an HTML document, $[officename] automatically converts date, time, and DocInformation fields to special HTML tags. The field contents are inserted between the opening and closing HTML tags of the converted fields. These special HTML tags do not correspond to standard HTML tags.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3152960	4			0	uk	$[officename] Writer fields are identified by the <SDFIELD> tag in an HTML document. The field type, the format, and the name of the special field are included in the opening HTML tag. The format of a field tag that is recognized by an HTML filter depends on the field type.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154570	5			0	uk	Поле дати і часу				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3149696	6			0	uk	For "Date" and "Time" fields, the TYPE parameter equals DATETIME. The format of the date or the time is specified by the SDNUM parameter, for example, DD:MM:YY for dates, or HH:MM:SS for time.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3155183	7			0	uk	For fixed date and time fields, the date or the time is specified by the SDVAL parameter.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3149485	8			0	uk	Examples of date and time special HTML tags that are recognized by $[officename] as fields are shown in the following table:				20220827 09:49:47
