helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3151257	6			0	uk	Inserts the contents of the database field that you specify in the \<emph\>Record Number\</emph\> box as a mail merge field if the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090200.xhp\" name=\"Condition\"\>\<emph\>Condition\</emph\>\</link\> that you enter is met. Only records selected by a multiple selection in the data source view are considered.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3147100	7			0	uk	You can use this field to insert several records into a document. Simply insert the \<emph\>Any Record\</emph\> field in front of the form letter fields that use a certain record.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3153632	8			0	uk	Назва бази даних				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3152776	9			0	uk	Inserts the name of the database table selected in the \<emph\>Database selection \</emph\>box. The "Database Name" field is a global field, that is, if you insert a different database name in your document, the contents of all previously inserted "Database Name" fields are updated.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3149167	15			0	uk	Поле розсилання листів				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3145779	16			0	uk	Inserts the name of a database field as a placeholder, so that you can create a mail merge document. The field content is automatically inserted when you print the form letter.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3151372	12			0	uk	Наступний запис				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3150114	13			0	uk	Inserts the contents of the next mail merge field in your document, if the condition that you define is met. The records that you want to include must be selected in the data source view.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3155861	14			0	uk	You can use the "Next record" field to insert the contents of consecutive records between the mail merge fields in a document.				20220827 09:49:47
