helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153876	54			0	uk	When you refer to a database field in a condition, use the form Databasename.Tablename.Fieldname. If one of the names contains a character that is an operator, such as a minus sign (-), enclose the name in square brackets, for example, Databasename.[Table-name].Fieldname. Never use spaces inside field names.				20220827 09:49:47
