helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060700.xhp	0	help	par_id3156043	6			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specify the macro that executes when the selected event occurs.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060700.xhp	0	help	par_id3156058	84			0	uk	Frames allow you to link certain events to a function that then decides if the event is handled by $[officename] Writer or by the function. See the $[officename] Basic Help for more information.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149271	7			0	uk	Категорія				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149284	8			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2:TABPAGE:RID_SFX_TP_MACROASSIGN\"\>Lists the $[officename] program and any open $[officename] document.\</ahelp\> Within this list, select the location where you want to save the macros.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156441	9			0	uk	Назва макроса				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060700.xhp	0	help	par_id3148458	10			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2:TABPAGE:RID_SFX_TP_MACROASSIGN\"\>Lists the available macros. Select the macro that you want to assign to the selected event, and then click \<emph\>Assign\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
