helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512	57			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OUTLINE_FORM\"\>Saves or loads an outline number format. A saved outline number format is available to all text documents.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150979	58			0	uk	The \<emph\>Format\</emph\> button is only available for outline numbering. For numbered or bulleted list styles, modify the Numbering Styles of the paragraphs.				20220827 09:49:47
