helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3149692	2			0	uk	DocInformation fields contain information about the properties of a document, such as the date a document was created. To view the properties of a document, choose \<emph\>File - Properties\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
