helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3146341	9			0	uk	Inserts fields containing user data. You can change the user-data that is displayed by choosing \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010100.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] - User Data\"\>$[officename] - User Data\</link\>\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
