helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3151091	23			0	uk	Inserts document statistics, such as page and word counts, as a field. To view the statistics of a document, choose \<emph\>File - Properties\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Statistics\</emph\> tab.               				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153302	16			0	uk	Шаблони				20220827 09:49:47
