helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Resizing and Moving Frames, Objects With the Keyboard				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154506				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>moving;objects and frames\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>objects;moving and resizing with keyboard\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>resizing;objects and frames, by keyboard\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154506	1			0	uk	Resizing and Moving Frames, Objects With the Keyboard				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145248	2			0	uk	You can resize and move selected frames and objects with the keyboard.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148771	4			0	uk	To move a selected frame or object, press an arrow key. To move by one pixel, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then press an arrow key.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150762	5			0	uk	To resize a selected frame or object, first press Ctrl+Tab. Now one of the handles blinks to show that it is selected. To select another handle, press Ctrl+Tab again. Press an arrow key to resize the object by one grid unit. To resize by one pixel, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then press an arrow key.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149294	6			0	uk	The increment by which you move an object with the keyboard is determined by the document grid. To change the properties of the document grid, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01050100.xhp\" name=\"Text document - Grid\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Grid\</link\>\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
