helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147171	2			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Fieldnames\"\>Switches the field display between field names and field contents.\</ahelp\> A check mark indicates that the field names are displayed, and no check mark indicates that field contents are displayed. Some field contents cannot be displayed.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149287	4			0	uk	To change the default field display to field names instead of the field contents, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - View\</emph\>, and then select the\<emph\> Field codes \</emph\>checkbox in the \<emph\>Display\</emph\> area.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154098	5			0	uk	When you print a document with \<emph\>View - Field Names\</emph\> enabled, you are prompted to include the field names in the print out.				20220827 09:49:47
