helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3151392	2			0	uk	\<variable id=\"spaltentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"HID_COLUMN\"\>Specifies the number of columns and the column layout for a page style, frame, or section.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155625	3			0	uk	Значення, встановлювані за умовчанням				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149352	4			0	uk	You can select from predefined column layouts, or create your own. When you apply a layout to a page style, all pages that use the style are updated. Similarly, when you apply a column layout to a frame style, all frames that use that style are updated. You can also change the column layout for a single frame.				20220827 09:49:47
