helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150954	38			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NAVI_DRAG_HYP\"\>Creates a hyperlink when you drag and drop an item into the current document. Click the hyperlink in the document to jump to the item that the hyperlink points to.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154354	39			0	uk	Вставити як посилання				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154371	40			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NAVI_DRAG_LINK\"\>Inserts the selected item as a link where you drag and drop in the current document. Text is inserted as protected sections. The contents of the link are automatically updated when the source is changed. To manually update the links in a document, choose \<emph\>Tools - Update - Links\</emph\>. You cannot create links for graphics, OLE objects, references and indexes.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155572	42			0	uk	Вставити як копію				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155589	43			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NAVI_DRAG_COPY\"\>Inserts a copy of the selected item where you drag and drop in the current document. You cannot drag and drop copies of graphics, OLE objects, references and indexes.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150507	45			0	uk	Рівні структури				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150529	46			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NAVI_TBX13\"\>Click this icon, and then choose the number of heading outline levels that you want to view in the Navigator window.\</ahelp\> You can also access this command by right-clicking a heading in the Navigator window.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148808	76			0	uk	1-10				20220827 09:49:47
