helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153667	4			0	uk	Enter the number of outline levels to include in the new presentation. For example, if you choose one level, only the paragraphs that follow the "Heading 1" paragraph style are included.				20220827 09:49:47
