helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151312	8			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_ENTRY\"\>Displays the text that is selected in the document. If you want, you can enter a different word for the index entry. The selected text in the document is not changed.\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154480	9			0	uk	1-й ключ				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152953	10			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_PRIM_KEY\"\>Makes the current selection a subentry of the word that you enter here. For example, if you select "cold", and enter "weather" as the 1st key, the index entry is "weather, cold".\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154572	11			0	uk	2-й ключ				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155904	12			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_SEC_KEY\"\>Makes the current selection a sub-subentry of the 1st key. For example, if you select "cold", and enter "weather" as the 1st key and "winter" as the 2nd key, the index entry is "weather, winter, cold".\</ahelp\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155174	39			0	uk	Фонетичне читання				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149484	40			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_PHONETIC_READING\"\>Enter the phonetic reading for the corresponding entry. For example, if a Japanese Kanji word has more than one pronunciation, enter the correct pronunciation as a Katakana word. The Kanji word is then sorted according to the phonetic reading entry.\</ahelp\> This option is only available if Asian language support is enabled.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143284	24			0	uk	Основний елемент				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151248	25			0	uk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_MAIN_ENTRY\"\>Makes the selected text the main entry in an alphabetical index.\</ahelp\> $[officename] displays the page number of the main entry in a different format than the other entries in the index.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149821	13			0	uk	Рівень				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147098	14			0	uk	Entries using the paragraph format "Heading X" (X = 1-10) can be automatically added to the table of contents. The level of the entry in the index corresponds to the outline level of the heading style.\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_LEVEL\"/\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149175	16			0	uk	This option is available only for table of contents and user-defined index entries.				20220827 09:49:47
