helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153511	16			0	uk	On the Insert toolbar, click the \<emph\>Table\</emph\> icon to open the \<emph\>Insert Table\</emph\> dialog, where you can insert a table in the current document. You can also click the arrow, drag to select the number of rows and columns to include in the table, and then click in the last cell.				20220827 09:49:47
