helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3149098	37			0	uk	The value of a variable in an Input field is only valid from where the field is inserted and onwards. To change the value of the variable later in the document, insert another Input field of the same name, but with a different value. However, the value of a User Field is changed globally.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3151255	38			0	uk	The variables are displayed in the \<emph\>Selection\</emph\> field. When you click the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> button, the dialog\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090100.xhp\" name=\"Input Field\"\>\<emph\>Input Field\</emph\>\</link\> appears, where you can enter the new value or additional text as a remark.				20220827 09:49:47
