helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\even_odd_sdw.xhp	0	help	par_id3147126	2			0	uk	$[officename] can automatically apply alternating page styles on even (left) and odd pages (right) in your document. For example, you can use page styles to display different headers and footers on even and odd pages. The current page style is displayed in the \<emph\>Status Bar\</emph\> at the bottom of the workplace.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\even_odd_sdw.xhp	0	help	hd_id8194219				0	uk	To Set Up Alternating Page Styles				20220827 09:49:47
