helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	par_id0509200916345516				0	uk	Wildcards or placeholders can be used to search for some unspecified or even invisible characters.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	par_id3155182	50			0	uk	You can use wildcards when you find and replace text in a document. For example, "s.n" finds "sun" and "son".				20220827 09:49:47
