helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3155872	60			0	uk	You can also make changes directly to an index or table of contents. Right-click in the index or table of contents, choose \<emph\>Edit Index/Table\</emph\>, click \<emph\>Index/Table\</emph\> tab, and then clear the \<emph\>Protected from manual changes\</emph\> check box.				20220827 09:49:47
