helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	par_id3155916	2			0	uk	You can change the case of text, format text with small capitals, or capitalize the first letter of each word in a selection.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	par_idN10728				0	uk	When you apply a formatting to your text by \<emph\>Format - Character\</emph\>, the text stays the same, it is only displayed in another way. On the other hand, when you choose \<emph\>Format - Change Case\</emph\>, the text is permanently changed.				20220827 09:49:47
