helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Inserting, Editing, and Linking Text Frames				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149487				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>text frames; inserting/editing/linking\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>editing;text frames\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>inserting;text frames\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>resizing;text frames, by mouse\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>scaling; text frames, by mouse\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>links;text frames\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text flow; from frame to frame\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>frames; linking\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>printing;hiding text frames from printing\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149487	3			0	uk	\<variable id=\"text_frame\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/text_frame.xhp\" name=\"Inserting, Editing, and Linking Text Frames\"\>Inserting, Editing, and Linking Text Frames\</link\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3149842	65			0	uk	A text frame is a container for text and graphics that you can place anywhere on a page. You can also use a frame to apply a column layout to text.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156104	64			0	uk	To Insert a Text Frame				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3149961	5			0	uk	Виділіть текст, який необхідно перемістити або скопіювати.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3149602	9			0	uk	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Frame\</emph\>, and click OK.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145115	66			0	uk	To Edit a Text Frame				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3149578	16			0	uk	To edit the contents of a text frame, click in the frame, and make the changes that you want.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3156239	14			0	uk	To edit a frame, select the frame, right-click, and then choose a formatting option. You can also right-click the selected frame, and choose \<emph\>Frame\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3156261	63			0	uk	To resize a text frame, click an edge of the frame, and drag one of the edges or corners of the frame. Hold down Shift while you drag to maintain the proportion of the frame.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153386	98			0	uk	To Hide Text From Printing				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3154262	99			0	uk	Any Writer text frame can be set to a mode which allows viewing the text on screen, but hides the text from printing.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3154858	100			0	uk	Select the text frame (you see the eight handles).				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3155875	101			0	uk	Виберіть \<emph\>Формат - Кадр - Параметри\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3155899	102			0	uk	In the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> area, unmark the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> check box and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148701	83			0	uk	To Link Text Frames				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3149986	84			0	uk	You can link Writer text frames so that their contents automatically flow from one frame to another.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3153025	71			0	uk	Click the edge of a frame that you want to link. Selection handles appear on the edges of the frame.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3150223	87			0	uk	On the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Frame\</item\> Bar, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Link Frames\</item\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3148968\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_chainframes.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height=\"0.222in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148968\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3150930	89			0	uk	Click the frame that you want to link to.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3150947	75			0	uk	You can only link frames if:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3150969	76			0	uk	The target frame is empty.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3154365	77			0	uk	The target frame is not linked to another frame.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3154383	78			0	uk	The source and the target frames are in the same section. For example, you cannot link a header frame to a footer frame.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3145559	79			0	uk	The source frame does not have a next link.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3145577	81			0	uk	The target or the source frame are not contained in each other.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3151083	90			0	uk	When you select a linked frame, a line is displayed that connects the linked frames.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id5853144				0	uk	The AutoSize feature is available only for the last frame in a chain of linked frames.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Hyphenation				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149695				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>hyphenation;manual/automatic\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>separation, see hyphenation\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>automatic hyphenation in text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>manual hyphenation in text\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149695	20			0	uk	\<variable id=\"using_hyphen\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/using_hyphen.xhp\" name=\"Hyphenation\"\>Hyphenation\</link\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3155918	31			0	uk	By default, $[officename] moves words that do not fit on a line to the next line. If you want, you can use automatic or manual hyphenation to avoid this behavior: 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155864	30			0	uk	Automatic Hyphenation				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3147414	22			0	uk	Automatic hyphenation inserts hyphens where they are needed in a paragraph. This option is only available for paragraph styles and individual paragraphs.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149832	51			0	uk	To Automatically Hyphenate Text in a Paragraph				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3148850	32			0	uk	Right-click in a paragraph, and choose \<emph\>Paragraph\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3156104	34			0	uk	Click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05030200.xhp\" name=\"Text Flow\"\>\<emph\>Text Flow\</emph\>\</link\> tab.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3150101	35			0	uk	In the Hyphenation area, select the Automatically check box.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3153121	52			0	uk	Натисніть \<emph\>Гаразд\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149629	53			0	uk	To Automatically Hyphenate Text in Multiple Paragraphs				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3149644	33			0	uk	If you want to automatically hyphenate more than one paragraph, use a paragraph style.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3149956	48			0	uk	For example, enable the automatic hyphenation option for the "Default" paragraph style, and then apply the style to the paragraphs that you want to hyphenate.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3149611	54			0	uk	Choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Paragraph Styles\</emph\> icon.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3149867	55			0	uk	Right-click the paragraph style that you want to hyphenate, and then choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3145106	56			0	uk	Click the Text Flow tab.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3149582	57			0	uk	В області \<emph\>Сховати\</emph\> встановіть прапорець \<emph\>Сховати\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3156250	58			0	uk	Натисніть \<emph\>Гаразд\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3145400	59			0	uk	Apply the style to the paragraphs that you want to hyphenate.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145417	36			0	uk	Manual Hyphenation				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3154400	23			0	uk	You can insert a hyphen where you want on a line, or let $[officename] search for the words to hyphenate, and then offer a suggested hyphenation.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help					0	uk	To Manually Hyphenate Single Words				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3153363	24			0	uk	To quickly insert a hyphen, click in the word where you want to add the hyphen, and then press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Hyphen(-).				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3154244	37			0	uk	If you insert a manual hyphen in a word, the word is only hyphenated at the manual hyphen. No additional automatic hyphenation is applied for this word. A word with a manual hyphen will be hyphenated without regard to the settings on the \<emph\>Text Flow\</emph\> tab page.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154847	60			0	uk	To Manually Hyphenate Text in a Selection				20220827 09:49:47
