helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3149645	6			0	uk	On the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> tab, ensure that \<emph\>Combine single line paragraphs if length greater than 50%\</emph\> is selected. To change the minimum percentage for the line length, double-click the option in the list, and then enter a new percentage.				20220827 09:49:47
