helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155861	34			0	uk	Помістіть курсор у тому місці документа, куди необхідно вставити кількість сторінок.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3147416	28			0	uk	On the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar, click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Table\</emph\> icon.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153398	29			0	uk	In the table grid, drag to select the numbers of rows and columns that you want, and then release.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153416	30			0	uk	To cancel, drag to the other side until \<emph\>Cancel\</emph\> appears in the preview area of the grid.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153135	35			0	uk	To Insert a Table With a Menu Command				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149642	36			0	uk	Помістіть курсор у тому місці документа, куди необхідно вставити кількість сторінок.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149609	37			0	uk	Choose \<emph\>Table - Insert - Table\</emph\>. 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149858	66			0	uk	In the \<emph\>Size\</emph\> area, enter the number of rows and columns.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145097	67			0	uk	Select the options that you want, click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149572	43			0	uk	To Insert a Table From a Calc Spreadsheet				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149594	44			0	uk	Open the $[officename] Calc spreadsheet containing the cell range that you want to insert.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3156250	45			0	uk	In the spreadsheet, drag to select the cells.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154395	68			0	uk	Виберіть\<emph\> Редагування - Копіювати\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154420	46			0	uk	In your text document, do one of the following:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153383	47			0	uk	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Paste\</emph\>. The cell range is pasted as an OLE object. To edit the contents of the cells, double-click the object.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154248	48			0	uk	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Paste Special\</emph\>, and choose from the following options:				20220827 09:49:47
