helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3147110	51			0	uk	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Default\</item\> area, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Set Top and Bottom Borders Only\</item\> icon.				20220827 09:49:47
