helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	hd_id6618243				0	uk	\<variable id=\"table_cellmerge\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/table_cellmerge.xhp\" name=\"Merging and Splitting Cells\"\>Merging and Splitting Cells\</link\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id1211890				0	uk	You can select adjacent cells, then merge them into a single cell. Conversely, you can take a large cell and divide it into individual cells.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	hd_id3463850				0	uk	To Merge Cells				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id5708792				0	uk	Select the adjacent cells.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id6301461				0	uk	Choose \<emph\>Table - Merge Cells\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
