helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155174				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>numbering; manually/by styles\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>manual numbering in text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>paragraph styles;numbering\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155174	30			0	uk	\<variable id=\"using_numbering\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/using_numbering.xhp\" name=\"Numbering and Numbering Styles\"\>Numbering and Numbering Styles\</link\> \</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149818	26			0	uk	You can apply numbering to a paragraph manually or with a paragraph style.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id6140629				0	uk	To Apply Numbering Manually				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3155866	33			0	uk	To apply numbering manually, click in the paragraph, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering On/Off\</item\> icon on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formatting\</item\> Bar.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3153405	27			0	uk	You cannot apply manual numbering to paragraphs that are listed under "Special Styles" in the Styles and Formatting window.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN10711				0	uk	When you press Enter in a numbered or bulleted list, \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> automatically numbers the next paragraph. To remove the numbering or bullet from the new paragraph, press Enter again.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN1072B				0	uk	To change the hierarchical level of a bullet in a list, click in front of the paragraph, then press the Tab key.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN1072F				0	uk	To change the bullets or numbering format for the current paragraph only, select a character or word in the paragraph, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Bullets and Numbering\</item\>, and then click a new format. 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN10733				0	uk	To change the bullet or numbering format for all paragraphs in the list, ensure that the cursor is in the list, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Bullets and Numbering\</item\>, and then click a new format. 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN10737				0	uk	To apply the same bullet or numbering format to all paragraphs in the list, select all paragraphs, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Bullets and Numbering\</item\>, and then click a format.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN1073A				0	uk	You can also use the commands on the \<link href=\"text/swriter/main0206.xhp\" name=\"Numbering Object Bar\"\>Bullets and Numbering\</link\> toolbar to edit a numbered or bulleted list. To change the numbering or bullet format, click the \<emph\>Bullets and Numbering\</emph\> icon.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153123	34			0	uk	To Apply Numbering With a Paragraph Style				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3153137	31			0	uk	Paragraph Styles give you greater control over numbering that you apply in a document. When you change the numbering format of the style, all paragraphs using the style are automatically updated.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149646	35			0	uk	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Paragraph Styles\</item\> icon.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149599	36			0	uk	Right-click the paragraph style that you want to apply numbering to, and then choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149850	37			0	uk	Click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Outline & Numbering\</item\> tab.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149874	38			0	uk	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering Style\</item\> box, select the type of numbering that you want to use.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3145113	39			0	uk	Натисніть \<emph\>Гаразд\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
