helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	hd_id1812799				0	uk	To Insert a Text File				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3155855	28			0	uk	Помістіть курсор у тому місці документа, куди необхідно вставити кількість сторінок.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3147412	30			0	uk	Виберіть \<emph\>Вставити - Кадр\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149839	31			0	uk	Виберіть графічний файл, який потрібно вставити, і натисніть кнопку \<emph\>Відкрити\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3148858	32			0	uk	The contents of the text document are embedded into the current document and are not updated if the source file is changed. If you want the contents to automatically update when you change the source document, insert the file as a link.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156105	33			0	uk	To Insert an Entire Text Document as a Link				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3150096	34			0	uk	Помістіть курсор у тому місці документа, куди необхідно вставити кількість сторінок.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3153404	35			0	uk	Виберіть \<emph\>Вставити - Розділ\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3153127	36			0	uk	Type a name in the \<emph\>New Section\</emph\> box, and then select the \<emph\>Link\</emph\> check box.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149642	37			0	uk	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File Name\</item\> box, type the name of the file that you want to insert, or click the browse button (\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>...\</item\>) and locate the file.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149968	38			0	uk	If the target text document contains sections, you can select the section that you want to insert in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Sections\</item\> box.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149619	39			0	uk	If you want, set the formatting options for the section.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149862	40			0	uk	Натисніть \<emph\>Вставити\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3145099	41			0	uk	$[officename] automatically updates the contents of the inserted section whenever the source document is changed. To manually update the contents of the section, choose \<emph\>Tools - Update - Update All\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
