helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	par_id3149632	3			0	uk	If you cannot see the field shading of the cross-reference, choose \<emph\>View - Field Shadings\</emph\> or press \<emph\>Ctrl+F8\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	par_id3149611	4			0	uk	Виберіть\<emph\> Редагування - Копіювати\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	par_id3145101	7			0	uk	Set the options that you want, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	par_id3154255	5			0	uk	Use the arrow buttons in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit Fields\</item\> dialog to browse through the cross-references in the current document.				20220827 09:49:47
