helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_small.xhp	0	help	par_id3155055	31			0	uk	Виконаєте одну з наступних дій.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_small.xhp	0	help	par_id3149603	20			0	uk	To print two pages side by side on the same sheet, select "2" in the \<emph\>Pages per sheet\</emph\> box.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_small.xhp	0	help	par_id3153388	22			0	uk	To print multiple pages on the same sheet, select the number of pages per sheet and optionally set the order of pages. The small preview shows the arrangement of pages. 				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_small.xhp	0	help	par_id3154841	21			0	uk	Натисніть \<emph\>Параметри\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_small.xhp	0	help	par_id3150004	23			0	uk	\<link href=\"text/swriter/main0210.xhp\" name=\"File - Page Preview\"\>File - Page Preview\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
