helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145576				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>thesaurus; related words\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>related words in thesaurus\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>spelling in thesaurus\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>dictionaries; thesaurus\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>lexicon, see thesaurus\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>synonyms in thesaurus\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>searching;synonyms\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145576	15			0	uk	\<variable id=\"using_thesaurus\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/using_thesaurus.xhp\" name=\"Thesaurus\"\>Thesaurus\</link\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3149820	16			0	uk	You can use the thesaurus to look up synonyms or related terms.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3155920	17			0	uk	Click in the word that you want to look up or replace.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3155867	39			0	uk	Виберіть \<emph\>Сервіс - Обчислити\</emph\>, або натисніть \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Знак плюс (+).				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3149848	40			0	uk	In the Alternatives list, click an entry to copy that related term to the "Replace with" text box.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3153136	45			0	uk	Optionally double-click an entry to look up related terms for that entry. On your keyboard, you can also press the arrow up or down keys to select an entry. Then press Return to replace, or press the spacebar to look up.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3149644	46			0	uk	Натисніть \<emph\>Delete\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3156263	19			0	uk	Initially, the thesaurus uses the language of the selected word in the document, if a thesaurus library for that language is installed. The title bar of the Thesaurus dialog displays the language in use.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3145113	18			0	uk	To look up the word in a different language, click the Language button, and select one of the installed thesaurus languages. A thesaurus library may not be available for all installed languages. You can install languages with a thesaurus library from the \<link href=\"https://extensions.openoffice.org/\"\>Extensions\</link\> web page.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3196263	19			0	uk	If a thesaurus library is installed for the language of a word, the context menu of the word shows a Synonyms submenu. Select any of the terms from the submenu to replace the word.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3154392	41			0	uk	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/06020000.xhp\" name=\"Тезаурус\"\>Тезаурус\</link\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Ваставка розділів				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149695				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>sections; inserting\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>inserting; sections\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>HTML documents;inserting linked sections\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>updating;linked sections, manually\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>links;inserting sections\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149695	16			0	uk	\<variable id=\"section_insert\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/section_insert.xhp\" name=\"Inserting Sections\"\>Inserting Sections\</link\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155917	26			0	uk	You can insert new sections, or links to sections in other documents into the current document. If you insert a section as a link, the content of the link changes when you modify the source document.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155863	27			0	uk	To Insert a New Section				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149843	23			0	uk	Click in your document where you want to insert a new section, or select the text that you want to convert to a section.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3156103	28			0	uk	If you select a text that occurs within a paragraph, the text is automatically converted into a new paragraph.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149281	24			0	uk	Виберіть \<emph\>Вставити - Розділ\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153404	29			0	uk	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>New Section\</item\> box, type a name for the section.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153127	25			0	uk	Set the options for the section, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149635	30			0	uk	To Insert a Section as a Link				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149648	31			0	uk	Before you can insert a section as link, you must first create sections in the source document.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149611	18			0	uk	When you open a document that contains linked sections, $[officename] prompts you to update the contents of the sections. To manually update a link, choose \<emph\>Tools - Update - Links\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149860	22			0	uk	You can also insert linked sections in HTML documents. When you view the page in a web browser, the content of the sections corresponds to the content of the sections at the time the HTML document was last saved.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145104	32			0	uk	Натисніть у документі там, де ви хочете вставити зв'язаний розділ.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3156241	33			0	uk	Виберіть \<emph\>Вставити - Розділ\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153363	34			0	uk	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>New Section\</item\> box, type a name for the section.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153387	35			0	uk	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Link\</item\> area, select the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Link\</item\> check box. \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WIN\"\>Under Windows, you can also select the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>DDE\</item\> check box to automatically update the contents of the section when the section in the source document is changed.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154852	36			0	uk	Click the browse button (\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>...\</item\>) next to the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File name\</item\> box.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155882	37			0	uk	Locate the document containing the section that you want to link to, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149978	38			0	uk	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Section\</item\> box, select the section that you want to insert.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3150003	39			0	uk	Натисніть \<emph\>Вставити\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
