helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3149970	105			0	uk	Right-click the template that you created, and choose \<emph\>Set as Default Template\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3149620	115			0	uk	Натисніть \<emph\>Закрити\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
