helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3149838	40			0	uk	Виберіть команду \<emph\>Формат - Стилі і форматування\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3156107	47			0	uk	Click the icon of the style category that you want to update.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3149283	41			0	uk	In the document, click from where you want to copy the updated style. For example, click a paragraph to which you applied some manual formatting that you want to copy now.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3153402	42			0	uk	In the Styles and Formatting window, click the style that you want to update.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3153119	43			0	uk	Натисніть іконку \<emph\>Створити стиль з виділеного\</emph\> і виберіть у підміню пункт \<emph\>Створити стиль з виділеного\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_update.xhp	0	help	par_id0310200910360780				0	uk	Only the manually formatted attributes of the text at the cursor position in the document will be added to the style that is selected in the Styles and Formatting window. Any attributes that were applied as part of a style will not be added to the updated style.				20220827 09:49:47
