helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\send2html.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uk	Saving Text Documents in HTML Format				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\send2html.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145087				0	uk	\<bookmark_value\>text documents; publishing in HTML\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>HTML documents; creating from text documents\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>homepage creation\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>saving;in HTML format\</bookmark_value\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\send2html.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145087	1			0	uk	\<variable id=\"send2html\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/send2html.xhp\" name=\"Saving Text Documents in HTML Format\"\>Saving Text Documents in HTML Format\</link\>\</variable\>				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\send2html.xhp	0	help	par_id3149825	2			0	uk	You can save a $[officename] Writer document in HTML format, so that you can view it in a web browser. If you want, you can associate a page break with a specific heading paragraph style to generate a separate HTML page each time the style appears in the document. $[officename] Writer automatically creates a page containing hyperlinks to each of these pages.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\send2html.xhp	0	help	par_id3155922	3			0	uk	When you save a text document in HTML format, any graphics in the document are saved in JPEG format. The name of the HTML document is added as a prefix to the name of the graphic file. The JPEG images are saved in the same folder as the HTML document and are referenced with <IMG> tags in the HTML code.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\send2html.xhp	0	help	par_id3155868	5			0	uk	Apply one of the default $[officename] heading paragraph styles, for example, "Heading 1", to the paragraphs where you want to generate a new HTML page.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\send2html.xhp	0	help	par_id3156100	6			0	uk	Виберіть \<emph\>Файл - Створити - Складений документ\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\send2html.xhp	0	help	par_id3149281	7			0	uk	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Styles\</item\> box, select the paragraph style that you want to use to generate a new HTML page.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\send2html.xhp	0	help	par_id3153407	9			0	uk	Enter a path and a name for the HTML document, and then click \<emph\>Save\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
