helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3154491	2			0	uk	Можна вставити поточну дату як поле, яке оновлюватиметься при кожному відкритті документа, або як неоновлюване поле.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3147679	3			0	uk	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and click the \<emph\>Document\</emph\> tab.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415	5			0	uk	Click “Date” in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list and do one of the following:				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3155602	6			0	uk	To insert the date as a field that updates each time you open the document, click ”Date” in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Select\</item\> list.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3154241	4			0	uk	To insert the date as a field that does not update, click “Date (fixed)” in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Select\</item\> list.				20220827 09:49:47
