helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3150513	5			0	uk	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Fields - Page Count\</item\>, and then enter a space.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3150537	6			0	uk	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Fields - Other\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Functions\</item\> tab.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3153166	9			0	uk	Click "Conditional text" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3145256	7			0	uk	Type \<item type=\"literal\"\>Page > 1\</item\> in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Condition\</item\> box.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3145280	10			0	uk	Type \<item type=\"literal\"\>Pages\</item\> in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Then\</item\> box.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3145305	11			0	uk	Type \<item type=\"literal\"\>Page\</item\> in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Else\</item\> box.				20220827 09:49:47
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3155535	8			0	uk	Натисніть \<emph\>Вставити\</emph\>, а потім натисніть \<emph\>Закрити\</emph\>.				20220827 09:49:47
